msgstr "完成剧情任务时是否显示通知。"

msgid "Create Jewellery that provides various bonuses when equipped."
msgstr "制作装备时提供各种加成的首饰。"

msgid "Select a tree to begin cutting it for Logs and other rewards."
msgstr "选择一棵树开始砍伐以获得原木及其他奖励。"

msgid "This is a small [b]description[/b] of the event that occured."
msgstr "这是该事件的一小段[b]描述[/b]。"

msgid "[color=#b5b5b5]Next unlock at[/color] [b]{0:N0} Knowledge[/b]"
msgstr "[color=#b5b5b5]下次解锁于[/color] [b]{0:N0} 知识[/b]"

msgid "Create components used in Fletching to craft Ranged equipment."
msgstr "制作制箭所用的组件，以打造远程装备。"

msgid "How long this recipe takes to grow before it can be harvested."
msgstr "此配方需要多久才能成长到可收获。"

