msgstr "技能等级提升时是否显示通知。"

msgid "Whether to display a notification when the Music track changes."
msgstr "音乐曲目切换时是否显示通知。"

msgid "The amount of times this product can regrow before disappearing."
msgstr "此产物在消失前可再生的次数。"

msgid "Recipes, if any, go here. Many items will have alternate recipes."
msgstr "配方（如有）写在这里。许多物品会有替代配方。"

msgid "This is a Passive Skill which progresses while you play the game."
msgstr "这是一个被动技能，在你游玩时持续进展。"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Your [color=#FFD16D]Proficiency[/color]: 0[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]你的 [color=#FFD16D]熟练度[/color]: 0[/color]"

