msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]Alt (长按)[/color]: [color=#E9DFC1]交互[/color]"

msgid "Animal Levels increase the average Skill XP & Item quantity output."
msgstr "动物等级提升平均技能经验和物品产量。"

msgid "Success! You will receive an email shortly to continue the process."
msgstr "成功！你很快会收到一封邮件以继续流程。"

msgid "Whether to show a Native OS notification when you level up a Skill."
msgstr "技能升级时是否显示系统通知。"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Product [color=#FFD16D]Difficulty[/color]: 0[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]产物 [color=#FFD16D]难度[/color]: 0[/color]"

msgid "[color=#b5b5b5]Next unlock after [/color][b]2 Minor Node Unlocks[/b]"
msgstr "[color=#b5b5b5]下次解锁在 [/color][b]2 个次要节点解锁后[/b]"

msgid "If disabled, Items will be destroyed if they cannot fit in your Bank."
msgstr "若禁用，无法放入库存的物品将被销毁。"

msgid "No Category selected.\nChoose one from the list above to get started."
msgstr "未选择分类。\n从上方列表中选择一个开始。"

msgid "Whether to show a Native OS notification when your Bank becomes full."
msgstr "库存满时是否显示系统通知。"

msgid "No Data Package Loaded. Create a New one, or Open an existing package."
msgstr "未加载数据包。请新建一个，或打开现有数据包。"

msgid "Purchase Farming Plots and plant Seeds to grow various types of Crops."
msgstr "购买农耕地块并种植种子以培育各类作物。"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]The [color=#FFD16D]Max HP[/color] of this Tree.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]此树的 [color=#FFD16D]最大生命值[/color]。[/color]"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Your [color=#FFD16D]Proficiency[/color]: {0:N0}[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]你的 [color=#FFD16D]熟练度[/color]: {0:N0}[/color]"

msgid "Craft Magic weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness in Combat."
msgstr "制作魔法武器与护甲以提升你在战斗中的效果。"

msgid "Discover rare animal species and collect special rewards while Hunting."
msgstr "在狩猎中发现稀有动物物种并收集特殊奖励。"

msgid "Select a rock to begin mining for Ore, Essence, Gems and other rewards."
msgstr "选择一块岩石开始开采矿石、精华、宝石及其他奖励。"

msgid "Some rocks also provide rewards with every hit, even before they break."
msgstr "有些岩石在被击碎前，每次敲击也会给予奖励。"

msgid "Whether to show a Native OS notification when a Mastery Guild ranks up."
msgstr "精通殿堂等级提升时是否显示系统通知。"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Product [color=#FFD16D]Difficulty[/color]: {0:N0}[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]产物 [color=#FFD16D]难度[/color]: {0:N0}[/color]"

msgid "Automatically closes the sidebar when you select an option, like a Skill."
msgstr "当你选择选项（如技能）时自动关闭侧边栏。"

msgid "Automatically enable Placeholder for every new Item added into your Bank."
msgstr "自动为存入库存的每件新物品启用占位。"

msgid "Some fishing spots offer special items that you can collect while fishing."
msgstr "有些钓点提供钓鱼时可收集的特殊物品。"

msgid "Whether to show a Native OS notification when an action/Skill has stopped."
msgstr "操作/技能停止时是否显示系统通知。"

msgid "Remix of CC sound https://freesound.org/people/josepharaoh99/sounds/352698/"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sorts Mastery Guild tasks by the most recently progressed or updated first."
msgstr "按最近推进或更新优先排序精通殿堂任务。"

msgid "Burn Logs to gain Firemaking XP and a chance to receive random item rewards."
msgstr "燃烧原木以获得生火经验并有几率获得随机物品奖励。"

msgid "Skill Level tasks will show their XP progress instead of the Level progress."
msgstr "技能等级任务将显示经验进度而非等级进度。"

msgid "Steal from NPCs, Stalls, Locked Chests and Heists to obtain various rewards."
msgstr "从NPC、摊位、上锁宝箱和劫案中偷取以获取各种奖励。"

msgid "[img height=1em][/img][b]Element[/b] vs [img height=1em][/img][b]Element[/b]"
msgstr "[img height=1em][/img][b]元素[/b] 对 [img height=1em][/img][b]元素[/b]"

msgid "2019 Epic Stock Media (Ambient Earth Nature Loops) https://epicstockmedia.com"
msgstr ""

msgid "Luck was on your side today.\nDespite your defeat, all your items remain safe."
msgstr "今天运气站在你这边。\n尽管你败了，所有物品都安然无恙。"

msgid "Sell <qty> for [img=20]res://Assets/Currencies/GoldPieces.svg[/img] <total> GP"
msgstr "出售 <qty> 换取 [img=20]res://Assets/Currencies/GoldPieces.svg[/img] <total> GP"

msgid "Stops your active Action when the Bank fails to add an Item due to being full."
msgstr "当库存因已满而无法存入物品时停止当前操作。"

msgid "Hit [b]2[/b] times, dealing [b]up to 75% of your Max Hit[/b] as damage per hit."
msgstr "命中[b]2[/b]次，每次造成[b]最高可达你最大伤害75%[/b]的伤害。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Ctrl + A[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]Select all Items in Tab[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]Ctrl + A[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]选择标签页中所有物品[/color]"

msgid "[color=orange_red][b]No Trap selected![/b]\nA Trap is required to Hunt.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=orange_red][b]未选择陷阱！[/b]\n狩猎需要陷阱。[/color]"

msgid "The amount of times this recipe can regrow after harvesting before disappearing."
msgstr "此配方在收获后可再生直至消失的次数。"

msgid "Whether to show a Native OS notification when a Mastery Guild Task is completed."
msgstr "精通殿堂任务完成时是否显示系统通知。"

msgid "Create Consumables and Accessories that provide useful bonuses to various skills."
msgstr "制作对多种技能提供有用加成的消耗品与饰品。"

msgid "Created in [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Crafting.png[/img][b]Crafting[/b]"
msgstr "制作于 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Crafting.png[/img][b]制作[/b]"

msgid "Created items have a chance to be destroyed based on the number of steps required."
msgstr "制作出的物品有几率根据所需步骤数被销毁。"

msgid "Only major features are highlighted. Smaller, more specific content not mentioned."
msgstr "仅突出主要功能。更细的具体内容未列出。"

msgid "Use the Grain Mill to produce Grain for Ranching, and Flour and Sugar for Cooking."
msgstr "使用谷物磨坊生产牧场用的谷物，以及烹饪用的面粉和糖。"

msgid "Allow navigation to the Shop when clicking on the Currency breakdown in the Header."
msgstr "点击标题栏的货币明细时允许跳转到商店。"

msgid "Increasing your Fortune boosts the quantity of item rewards received from Thieving."
msgstr "提升运势可增加偷窃获得的物品奖励数量。"

msgid "No Area currently selected.\nChoose an Area from the left-hand side to get started."
msgstr "当前未选择区域。\n从左侧选择一个区域开始。"

msgid "[center]Your [b]Woodcutting[/b] is now [b][color=green]Level 2[/color][/b][/center]"
msgstr "[center]你的[b]伐木[/b]现在是[b][color=green]2级[/color][/b][/center]"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Shift + Left Click[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]Select bulk Items[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]Shift + 左键[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]批量选择物品[/color]"

msgid "Most Animals require Food to stay healthy, while some can survive without being fed."
msgstr "大多数动物需要食物来保持健康，有些则无需喂食也能存活。"

msgid "Allow navigation to the Bank when clicking on the Bank space breakdown in the Header."
msgstr "点击标题栏的库存空间明细时允许跳转到库存。"

msgid "Reconnection can be attempted via the [img=16]res://Assets/menu.png[/img] Pause menu."
msgstr "可通过 [img=16]res://Assets/menu.png[/img] 暂停菜单尝试重新连接。"

msgid "Show arrows next to modifiers to indicate their kind (Positive, Negative or Neutral)."
msgstr "在修正旁显示箭头以指示其类型（正面、负面或中立）。"

msgid "<<<Grants absolutely nothing just so I can see what a multi-line passive looks like>>>"
msgstr "<<<什么都不给，只是为了看看多行被动长什么样>>>"

msgid "Protect Crops from Pests and Disease, and keep them Watered to maximise their rewards."
msgstr "保护作物免受害虫和疾病侵害，并保持浇水以最大化其奖励。"

msgid "Smelt Ores obtained from Mining into Bars used for crafting equipment and other items."
msgstr "将采矿获得的矿石冶炼成锭，用于制作装备和其他物品。"

msgid "Some trees also provide rewards with every hit, even before their Health reaches zero."
msgstr "有些树在生命值归零前每次砍击也会给予奖励。"

msgid "Start with [b]3 stacks[/b]. Gain [b]1 stack[/b] per hit. Lose [b]1 stack[/b] when hit."
msgstr "以[b]3层[/b]开始。每次击打获得[b]1层[/b]。被击打时失去[b]1层[/b]。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Ctrl + Left Click[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]Select additional Item[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]Ctrl + 左键[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]加选物品[/color]"

msgid "Mini Games, Hit, Wood, Impact, Strike, Knock, Thud, Slam, Crash, Splinter, Break, Timber"
msgstr ""

msgid "The value of Pests this recipe attracts.\nAffects final product quantity if not managed."
msgstr "此配方吸引的害虫值。\n若不处理，将影响最终产物数量。"

msgid "Use Firemaking to light Lanterns, providing you with Light to take on Dark Combat Areas."
msgstr "使用生火点亮提灯，为你提供光明以应对黑暗战斗区域。"

msgid "No Loot History registered.\n\nLoot History for this Enemy will appear when you slay one."
msgstr "暂无战利品记录。\n\n击杀一只后，该敌人的战利品记录就会显示在这里。"

msgid "Technique bonuses are applied to all obstacles, regardless of what Technique provides it."
msgstr "无论由哪种技巧提供，技巧加成都会作用于所有障碍。"

msgid "[color=orange_red][b]Cannot Build[/b][/color]\nExisting enclosure must be empty to build."
msgstr "[color=orange_red][b]无法建造[/b][/color]\n现有围栏必须为空才能建造。"

msgid "The value of Disease this recipe attracts.\nAffects final product quantity if not managed."
msgstr "此配方吸引的疾病值。\n若不处理，将影响最终产物数量。"

msgid "Each hit reduces the tree's Health. Reduce its Health to 0 to collect its  primary rewards."
msgstr "每次砍击都会降低树的生命值。将其生命值降至0以收取主要奖励。"

msgid "Tooltip interactability is enabled by toggling the interact key instead of holding it down."
msgstr "通过切换交互键而非长按来启用提示框交互。"

msgid "Use Compost Bins to create Compost, which can be applied to Crops to increase their output."
msgstr "使用堆肥箱制作堆肥，施用于作物可提高产量。"

msgid "Buy [color=orange]Land[/color] and build an [color=orange]Enclosure[/color] to see overview."
msgstr "购买[color=orange]土地[/color]并建造[color=orange]围栏[/color]以查看概览。"

msgid "[b]First Pet[/b]\n[img=88]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [color=green]+10 XP[/color]"
msgstr "[b]第一只宠物[/b]\n[img=88]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [color=green]+10 经验[/color]"

msgid "+4% chance to deal double damage in Woodcutting\n+0.13% Bird/Eagle Nest chance in Woodcutting"
msgstr "伐木时 +4% 几率造成双倍伤害\n伐木时 +0.13% 鸟巢/鹰巢几率"

msgid "+8% chance to deal double damage in Woodcutting\n+0.13% Bird/Eagle Nest chance in Woodcutting"
msgstr "伐木时 +8% 几率造成双倍伤害\n伐木时 +0.13% 鸟巢/鹰巢几率"

msgid "Apply colour to the whole modifier text to indicate its kind (Positive, Negative or Neutral)."
msgstr "为整段修正文本上色以指示其类型（正面、负面或中立）。"

msgid "+15% chance to deal double damage in Woodcutting\n+0.13% Bird/Eagle Nest chance in Woodcutting"
msgstr "伐木时 +15% 几率造成双倍伤害\n伐木时 +0.13% 鸟巢/鹰巢几率"

msgid "Select [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Combat_64.png[/img] [b]Standard Mode[/b][/center]"
msgstr "选择 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Combat_64.png[/img] [b]标准模式[/b][/center]"

msgid "Your chance to successfully steal depends on your Stealth compared to the target's Perception."
msgstr "偷窃能否成功，取决于你的潜行与目标感知的对比。"

msgid "Use materials obtained from Hunting and Combat to create various types of specialised equipment."
msgstr "使用狩猎和战斗获得的材料制作各类专业装备。"

msgid "Your Demo saves will continue to work in the Early Access version! There will be no save resets."
msgstr "你的试玩版存档在抢先体验版中仍可继续使用！不会重置存档。"

msgid "Animals automatically produce XP and item rewards every hour. Proper care increases their output."
msgstr "动物每小时自动产出经验和物品奖励。妥善照料可提高其产出。"

msgid "Grow Allotments for Cooking, Herbs for Herblore, Trees for Skill XP, and Orchard Trees for Fruit."
msgstr "种植菜地供烹饪、草药供草药学、树木供技能经验、果园供水果。"

msgid "Repair Enclosures to keep them in good condition, and give your Animals Pets to meet their needs."
msgstr "修理围栏以保持其良好状态，并给动物配宠物以满足它们的需求。"

msgid "Whether to show certain notifications using your operating system's built-in notification system."
msgstr "是否使用操作系统内置通知系统显示某些通知。"

msgid "Whether to display a notification when you progress a Mastery Guild task to a pre-defined percent."
msgstr "当精通殿堂任务推进到预设百分比时是否显示通知。"

msgid "If you already registered to Melvor Cloud via Melvor Idle, you can use those details to login here."
msgstr "如果你已通过梅尔沃放置注册 Melvor 云，可使用那些信息在此登录。"

msgid "Maintain your Animals' Comfort and increase their Satisfaction to improve the rewards they produce."
msgstr "维持动物的舒适度并提升其满意度，以改善它们产出的奖励。"

msgid "Use Lockpicks to open Locked Chests, or find their Keys to greatly reduce the Lockpick requirement."
msgstr "使用开锁器打开上锁宝箱，或找到其钥匙以大幅降低开锁器需求。"

msgid "Opening stopped due to insufficient inventory space. Clear space and open again to receive the Item."
msgstr "因背包空间不足而停止开启。清理空间后再次开启以领取物品。"

msgid "Speciality Courses for various rewards or unlocks. These do not provide Agility Technique experience."
msgstr "提供各种奖励或解锁的特种课程。这些不提供敏捷技巧经验。"

msgid "An animal that resembles a question mark. Melvor is home to some pretty interesting species of animals."
msgstr "一只形似问号的动物。梅尔沃有一些相当有趣的动物物种。"

msgid "Automatically sorts your Bank when Items are added. This is useful for maintaining custom Item ordering."
msgstr "物品存入时自动整理你的库存。这有助于维持自定义物品顺序。"

msgid "Many fishing spots contain multiple types of Fish. Each catch randomly determines which Fish you receive."
msgstr "许多钓点包含多种鱼类。每次捕获随机决定你获得哪条鱼。"

msgid "Each hit has a chance to break the rock. If the Rock Break Bar reaches 100%, the rock automatically breaks."
msgstr "每次敲击都有几率击碎岩石。若击碎条达到 100%，岩石会被自动击碎。"

msgid "Animals come in different Sizes and Weights. Larger and heavier animals provide greater rewards when caught."
msgstr "动物有不同体型和重量。更大更重的动物被捕获时提供更多奖励。"

msgid "Clears this Plot by removing the Planted Product and Compost.\nThis action will [b]not[/b] refund any Items."
msgstr "清除此地块上已种植的产物和堆肥。\n此操作[b]不会[/b]返还任何物品。"

msgid "[b]More Task types coming soon:[/b]\n[ul] Locate/obtain Pets\n Complete Quests\n Find rare/hidden items[/ul]"
msgstr "[b]更多任务类型即将推出：[/b]\n[ul] 寻找/获得宠物\n 完成剧情任务\n 寻找稀有/隐藏物品[/ul]"

msgid "[b][color=green]Feedback Survey #6[/color][/b] is now live! Please complete if you have a spare 5-10 minutes."
msgstr "[b][color=green]反馈问卷 #6[/color][/b] 现已上线！如果你有 5-10 分钟空余，请填写。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Double Click[/color] [color=light_gray]on Bank Tab[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]Edit Bank Tab Label"
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]双击[/color] [color=light_gray]库存标签页[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]编辑库存标签页名称"

msgid "Burn special Prayer-related items obtained from Combat to gain Prayer Points (used to train the Prayer Skill)."
msgstr "燃烧战斗中获得的祈祷相关特殊物品以获得祈祷点（用于训练祈祷技能）。"

msgid "Cook various types of Food to restore Health when consumed. Some Food also provides special bonuses when used."
msgstr "烹饪各类食物，食用后恢复生命。有些食物使用时还提供特殊加成。"

msgid "Complete multi-step Heists to earn rewards at each successful step, with rare rewards available upon completion."
msgstr "完成多步骤劫案，在每个成功步骤获得奖励，完成时可获得稀有奖励。"

msgid "Hunt various animals to collect rewards. Each animal requires a specific type of Trap, created through Crafting."
msgstr "狩猎各种动物以收集奖励。每种动物需要特定类型的陷阱，通过制作获得。"

msgid "Makes all press and hold buttons require a single mouse click to work. Overrides any individual button settings."
msgstr "使所有长按按钮只需单击一次即可生效。会覆盖各按钮的单独设置。"

msgid "This is a loop-able nature ambience sound effect from Epic Stock Media's Ambient Earth Nature Loops sound library."
msgstr ""

msgid "[ul]Keep your Animals fed every hour.\nLose 10% every hour an Animal is not fed.\nReplenish to 100% when fed.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]每小时保持动物进食。\n动物未进食时每小时降低10%。\n喂食后恢复至100%。[/ul]"

msgid "2023 SwishSwoosh (Mini Games Sound Effects and Music Pack) https://www.swish-swoosh.com/collections/all-sound-packs"
msgstr ""

msgid "Provides a boost to [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/Satisfaction.png[/img][b]Satisfaction[/b]"
msgstr "提升 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/Satisfaction.png[/img][b]满意度[/b]"

msgid "This Roadmap only shows features yet to be released as of the date of the Roadmap (with the exception of Platforms)."
msgstr "此路线图仅显示截至路线图发布之日尚未推出的功能（平台除外）。"

msgid "[center][img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Items/NormalLog.png[/img] [b][color=green]20,000[/color] in Bank[/b][/center]"
msgstr "[center][img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Items/NormalLog.png[/img] [b]库存中有 [color=green]20,000[/color][/b][/center]"

msgid "An external browser window should have opened. Please follow the prompts and paste the retrieved code in the box below."
msgstr "应已打开一个外部浏览器窗口。请按提示操作，并将获取的代码粘贴到下方框中。"

msgid "Each item requires a set number of steps to complete. Ingredients are consumed and rewards are granted upon completion."
msgstr "每件物品需要固定的步骤数完成。材料会消耗，完成后给予奖励。"

msgid "Each animal has its own Level and XP. Successfully hunting an animal increases its XP, unlocking bonuses as it levels up."
msgstr "每只动物都有自己的等级和经验。成功狩猎动物会增加其经验，升级时解锁加成。"

msgid "Purchase Land, build Enclosures, and buy Animals using Gold Pieces. Each Animal has a limited lifespan before it moves on."
msgstr "用金币购买土地、建造围栏并购买动物。每只动物寿命有限，之后会离开。"

msgid "Craft powerful Slayer weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness during Slayer training for all Melee, Ranged and Magic"
msgstr "制作强力的讨伐武器与护甲，以提升你在所有近战、远程和魔法讨伐训练中的效果"

msgid "Apply this setting to all unlocked Plots in this category.\n\n[b]Note:[/b] Only applies to Plots with a [b]Planted[/b] Product."
msgstr "将此设置应用到此类别中所有已解锁地块。\n\n[b]注意：[/b] 仅适用于已[b]种植[/b]产物的地块。"

msgid "Apply this setting to all unlocked Plots in this category.\n\n[b]Note:[/b] Only applies to Plots with a [b]Selected[/b] Product."
msgstr "将此设置应用到此类别中所有已解锁地块。\n\n[b]注意：[/b] 仅适用于已[b]选中[/b]产物的地块。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Middle Mouse Click[/color] [color=light_gray]on Bank Tab[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]Delete Bank Tab[color=light_gray]"
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]中键点击[/color] [color=light_gray]库存标签页[/color]\n[color=#E9DFC1]删除库存标签页[color=light_gray]"

msgid "[ul]Animals have unique needs that can be met to boost Satisfaction.\nManaging this allows Happiness to increase above 100%.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]动物有独特需求，满足后可提升满意度。\n妥善管理可使幸福度超过100%。[/ul]"

msgid "Automate Planting, Harvesting, Watering and Composting to manage your Crops automatically.\n\nAutomation consumes Wine to operate."
msgstr "自动化种植、收获、浇水和施肥，以自动管理作物。\n\n自动化运行会消耗葡萄酒。"

msgid "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/info.png[/img] Compost is created via [b]Compost Bins[/b], unlocked at [b]Farming Level 5[/b]"
msgstr "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/info.png[/img] 堆肥通过[b]堆肥箱[/b]制作，[b]农耕5级[/b]解锁"

msgid "Select from [color=#FFD16D]Combat Areas, Slayer Zones[/color] or [color=#FFD16D]Dungeons[/color] to find different enemies to battle."
msgstr "从[color=#FFD16D]战斗区域、讨伐区域[/color]或[color=#FFD16D]地牢[/color]中选择不同的敌人进行战斗。"

msgid "[ul]Keep Enclosures repaired as they degrade by 1% every hour.\nThis does not affect Animal's Happiness until it falls below 75%.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]围栏每小时损耗1%，请保持修理。\n在低于75%之前不会影响动物的幸福度。[/ul]"

msgid "There is a small chance to locate a [b]Rare Species[/b] of an animal while Hunting. Some rare species may drop rare or plentiful items."
msgstr "狩猎时有小概率发现动物的[b]稀有物种[/b]。部分稀有物种可能掉落稀有或大量物品。"

msgid "+8% chance to deal double damage in Woodcutting\n+0.13% Bird/Eagle Nest chance in Woodcutting\n+0.1% \"On Cut\" Item chance in Woodcutting"
msgstr "伐木时 +8% 几率造成双倍伤害\n伐木时 +0.13% 鸟巢/鹰巢几率\n伐木时 +0.1% 「砍伐时」物品几率"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1][color=#FFD16D]All[/color] damage dealt grants healing equal to [color=#FFD16D]Damage dealt * Lifesteal %[/color].[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]造成的[color=#FFD16D]所有[/color]伤害都会提供等同于[color=#FFD16D]造成伤害 * 吸血百分比[/color]的治疗。[/color]"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Toggle visibility of this Rock.\n\nUse the [color=#FFD16D]Show hidden[/color] filtering option to see hidden Rocks.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]切换此岩石的可见性。\n\n使用[color=#FFD16D]显示隐藏[/color]筛选选项查看隐藏的岩石。[/color]"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Toggle visibility of this Tree.\n\nUse the [color=#FFD16D]Show hidden[/color] filtering option to see hidden Trees.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]切换此树木的可见性。\n\n使用[color=#FFD16D]显示隐藏[/color]筛选选项查看隐藏的树木。[/color]"

msgid "Your [b]Accuracy Rating[/b] & [b]Evasion Rating[/b] is reduced by [b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b] per Light value below the Darkness value."
msgstr "每点低于黑暗值的光明值会使你的[b]命中评级[/b]和[b]闪避评级[/b]降低[b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b]。"

msgid "Your [b]Accuracy Rating[/b] & [b]Evasion Rating[/b] is reduced\n by [b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b] per Light value below the Darkness value."
msgstr "你的[b]命中评级[/b]和[b]闪避评级[/b]\n每点低于黑暗值的光明值降低[b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b]。"

msgid "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] is calculated as the average of these 3 substats:"
msgstr "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]由这3项子属性的平均值计算："

msgid "Take a look at the [color=#FFD16D]Equipment Stats[/color] tab to see how this is calculated in relation to your [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color]."
msgstr "查看[color=#FFD16D]装备属性[/color]标签页，了解此属性与你[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]的计算关系。"

msgid "Rare Events can be activated (and paused) at any time within the Skill.\nOnly one Rare Event can be pending or activated at any time within each Skill."
msgstr "稀有事件可在该技能中随时激活（和暂停）。\n每个技能中同一时间只能有一个稀有事件待触发或激活。"

msgid "Planned Features are not final. We will be listening to all feedback during testing periods, and adding/removing/adjusting based on feedback & suggestions!"
msgstr "计划功能并非最终版本。我们会倾听测试期间的所有反馈，并根据反馈与建议增删调整！"

msgid "Each weapon has different [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] to choose from. Your selected [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color] determines which Combat Skills gain XP."
msgstr "每把武器有不同的[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]可选。你选择的[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]决定哪些战斗技能获得经验。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color] are toggleable passive effects that can buff your Character. These cost [color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] to remain active."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]祈祷[/color]是可切换的被动效果，可强化你的角色。维持激活需要消耗[color=#FFD16D]祈祷点[/color]。"

msgid "[color=green]Begin the Skill by purchasing your first plot of [b][color=white]Land[/color][/b] and building an [b][color=white]Enclosure[/color][/b].[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]购买你的第一块[b][color=white]土地[/color][/b]并建造一个[b][color=white]围栏[/color][/b]来开始此技能。[/color]"

msgid "Your Pest Protection / Product's Pest Attraction.\n- Reduces final product quantity if not maintained.\n- This can be maintained while the product is growing."
msgstr "你的害虫防护 / 产物的害虫吸引。\n- 若不维持会降低最终产物数量。\n- 产物成长期间可维护。"

msgid "Your [b]Accuracy Rating[/b] & [b]Evasion Rating[/b] is reduced by [b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b] per your [b]Light[/b] value below the [b]Darkness[/b] value."
msgstr "你的[b]命中评级[/b]和[b]闪避评级[/b]每点[b]光明[/b]值低于[b]黑暗[/b]值时降低[b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b]。"

msgid "The final adjustment to your product quantity based on\nPests & Disease Maintenance.\nOnly applied when product is [b]fully grown[/b], after all other bonuses."
msgstr "基于害虫与疾病维护，\n对产物数量的最终调整。\n仅在产物[b]完全成长[/b]后，于其他所有加成之后应用。"

msgid "Update schedule is not final and can change without warning depending on many factors such as development timelines, prioritisation, and feedback from testing."
msgstr "更新计划并非最终版本，可能因开发时间线、优先级和测试反馈等诸多因素在无预警情况下变动。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] are obtained by buring [u]Bones[/u] dropped from slain Enemies (via your Bank), or through other methods such as Firemaking."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]祈祷点[/color]可通过燃烧被击杀敌人掉落的[u]骨头[/u]（在你的库存中）或其他方式（如生火）获得。"

msgid "Your Disease Protection / Product's Disease Attraction.\n- Reduces final product quantity if not maintained.\n- This can be maintained while the product is growing."
msgstr "你的疾病防护 / 产物的疾病吸引。\n- 若不维持会降低最终产物数量。\n- 产物成长期间可维护。"

msgid "Create various types of Ranged weapons and ammunition for use in Combat.\n\nSome weapons require a certain type of ammunition, while others can be used individually."
msgstr "制作各类远程武器和弹药用于战斗。\n\n有些武器需要特定类型的弹药，其他则可单独使用。"

msgid "Hunting is automatic and involves three stages: Surveying an area, Tracking an animal, and attempting to Trap it.\n\nIf trapping fails, the animal flees and must be tracked again."
msgstr "狩猎是自动的，包括三个阶段：勘测区域、追踪动物、尝试设陷阱。\n\n若设陷阱失败，动物会逃走，必须重新追踪。"

msgid "Failing to steal causes you to take damage and become stunned. Dying may result in losing an equipped item.\n\nEquip Food from Cooking to automatically heal when your Health is low."
msgstr "偷窃失败会使你受到伤害并陷入眩晕。死亡可能导致失去一件已装备物品。\n\n装备烹饪食物，在生命值低时自动治疗。"

msgid "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Woodcutting.png[/img] [b]Woodcutting[/b] [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/Woodcutting/Trees/Oak.png[/img] [b]Oak Tree[/b] for [b]1d 5h 32m"
msgstr "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Woodcutting.png[/img] [b]伐木[/b] [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/Woodcutting/Trees/Oak.png[/img] [b]橡树[/b] 持续 [b]1d 5h 32m"

msgid "[ul]Equals the [b]Maintenance[/b] value of this Enclosure.\nRepair the Enclosure to maintain this stat, simple.\nHas no effect on [b]Happiness[/b] until it falls below [color=orange]75%[/color][/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]等同于此围栏的[b]维护[/b]值。\n修理围栏即可维持此数值，很简单。\n在低于[color=orange]75%[/color]之前不影响[b]幸福度[/b][/ul]"

msgid "Automatically rebuys an Animal that passes away.\n\n[b][color=orange_red]Warning![/color][/b][br]Enabling this can get expensive over time, especially if you forget about it.[br]Proceed with caution."
msgstr "自动回购已离世的动物。\n\n[b][color=orange_red]警告！[/color][/b][br]启用后长期开销可能很大，尤其当你忘记它的时候。[br]请谨慎操作。"

msgid "Perform a catch attempt. If you catch the Priority Fish, continue as normal.\nIf not, immediately perform another standard catch attempt.\nSpecial Item rolls only occur once during this whole process."
msgstr "尝试捕获一次。若捕到优先鱼，则照常继续。\n若没有，立刻再按标准流程尝试一次。\n特殊物品抽取在整个过程中只发生一次。"

msgid "The [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] you use determines the [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] available to choose from. Not all [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color] have access to all [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color]."
msgstr "你使用的[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]决定可选择的[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]。并非所有[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]都能使用所有[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]。"

msgid "Any new Item stack that contains any of the enabled tags will be placed into this Bank Tab automatically (First match, left-to-right).\n\nCustom Sorting order with Auto Sorting enabled overrides this affinity."
msgstr "任何包含已启用标签的新物品组都会自动放入此库存标签页（左至右首个匹配）。\n\n启用自动排序时的自定义排序顺序会覆盖此归属。"

msgid "Battle enemies to gain [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] and collect valuable rewards as loot. [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] is granted based on the [color=#FFD16D]weapon damage[/color] you deal."
msgstr "与敌人战斗以获得[color=#FFD16D]战斗技能经验[/color]，并收集有价值的战利品。[color=#FFD16D]战斗技能经验[/color]根据你造成的[color=#FFD16D]武器伤害[/color]给予。"

msgid "[b]Traps[/b] are required to hunt an Animal. Different Animals require different types of [b]Traps[/b].\n\n[b]Traps[/b] can be created in [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Crafting.png[/img][b]Crafting[/b]."
msgstr "狩猎动物需要[b]陷阱[/b]。不同动物需要不同类型的[b]陷阱[/b]。\n\n[b]陷阱[/b]可在 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Crafting.png[/img][b]制作[/b] 中制作。"

msgid "This update will add content from Level 100-120 for all released Skills.\n\nThis is our \"test\" for expansion releases, allowing us to fine-tune the process of adding new content above levels currently available."
msgstr "此更新将为所有已发布技能加入100-120级内容。\n\n这是我们为扩展发布进行的「测试」，以便微调在现有等级之上添加新内容的流程。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Prayer XP[/color] is gained while actively using [color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color]. Your damage dealt and cost of the Prayer determines the XP gained, with higher cost Prayers providing more XP per damage."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]祈祷经验[/color]在主动使用[color=#FFD16D]祈祷[/color]时获得。你的造成伤害和祈祷消耗决定获得的经验，消耗越高的祈祷每点伤害提供的经验越多。"

msgid "Collectables can be obtained from certain [b]Rare Species[/b] of Animals as a rare drop. These collectables will be utilised in the [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Construction.png[/img][b]Construction[/b] Skill."
msgstr "收集品可作为稀有掉落从某些动物的[b]稀有物种[/b]处获得。这些收集品将用于 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Construction.png[/img][b]建造[/b] 技能。"

msgid "Your chance to successfully cook Food depends on your Cooking Proficiency compared to the Food's Difficulty.\n\nCooking Proficiency can be increased by leveling Cooking, equipping Items, or via the Shop or other Skills."
msgstr "你成功烹饪食物的几率取决于你的烹饪熟练度与食物难度的对比。\n\n烹饪熟练度可通过提升烹饪等级、装备物品，或通过商店及其他技能提高。"

msgid "Locking your Bank Configuration will remove the ability to manually rearrange Items, manage Bank tabs, and manage affinities.\nThis is useful if you create or import a specific Bank Configuration and don't want to edit it."
msgstr "锁定库存配置将移除手动重排物品、管理库存标签页和管理归属的能力。\n如果你创建或导入了特定库存配置且不想被修改，这会很有用。"

msgid "The [color=#FFD16D]Magic Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapon[/color] in combination with the the use of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color]. These cost [u]Runes[/u] primarily obtained from Runecrafting."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]魔法战斗风格[/color]需要[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]并配合使用[color=aqua]魔法咒语[/color]。这些消耗主要来自符文制作的[u]符文[/u]。"

msgid "[b][color=orange_red][font_size=20]Warning![/font_size][/color][/b]\nYou have Animals in this Enclosure.\n\nThese Animals will be [b][color=orange_red]removed[/color][/b] if you replace the Enclosure.\n\n[b]This cannot be undone.[/b]"
msgstr "[b][color=orange_red][font_size=20]警告！[/font_size][/color][/b]\n此围栏中有动物。\n\n如果你替换此围栏，这些动物将被[b][color=orange_red]移除[/color][/b]。\n\n[b]此操作无法撤销。[/b]"

msgid "[ul]Animals have needs & wants that provide [b]Satisfaction[/b].\nMaintain these, and you'll be rewarded with very happy animals.[/ul]\n\nHover over an animal to see their [b]Satisfaction Checklist[/b]. Every animal of the same type has the same list."
msgstr "[ul]动物有需求和愿望，可提供[b]满意度[/b]。\n维持这些，你会得到非常快乐的动物作为回报。[/ul]\n\n将鼠标悬停在动物上查看其[b]满意度清单[/b]。同类型的每只动物清单相同。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Equip [u]Food[/u][/color] to automatically restore Health when it falls below a set threshold, helping you survive longer battles.\n\nMore information is contained by hovering over the [color=#FFD16D]Auto Eat icon on your Health Bar[/color]."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]装备[u]食物[/u][/color]可在生命值低于设定阈值时自动恢复生命，帮助你撑过更长的战斗。\n\n将鼠标悬停在[color=#FFD16D]生命条上的自动进食图标[/color]上可查看更多信息。"

msgid "Ranching is a [b]Passive[/b] Skill designed to provide important raw resources used around the game in a passive manner.\n\nIt is not designed to be the primary source of these resources, but instead be a source that can produce as you work on other Skills."
msgstr "牧场是一个[b]被动[/b]技能，旨在以被动方式提供游戏中各处使用的重要原材料。\n\n它的设计目的不是这些资源的主要来源，而是在你进行其他技能时作为一种产出来源。"

msgid "Generates a base64 string based on your current Bank Configuration, which can be shared or uploaded to the Cloud.\nBank Configurations include all Bank tabs & custom labels, Bank tab affinities, default Item tab & placement order, and Item locked & placeholder status."
msgstr "根据你当前的库存配置生成一个 base64 字符串，可分享或上传到云端。\n库存配置包括所有库存标签页及自定义名称、标签页归属、默认物品标签与摆放顺序，以及物品锁定与占位状态。"

msgid "[b]Hunting Tools[/b] are used automatically during the Hunting process.\n\nBonuses can be applied to specific [b]Hunting Tools[/b] via the [img height=1em]res://Assets/Icons/Shop_64.png[/img] [b]Shop[/b] and other means.\n\nSome animals do not use [b]Hunting Tools[/b]."
msgstr "[b]狩猎工具[/b]会在狩猎过程中自动使用。\n\n可通过 [img height=1em]res://Assets/Icons/Shop_64.png[/img] [b]商店[/b] 及其他方式为特定[b]狩猎工具[/b]添附加成。\n\n有些动物不使用[b]狩猎工具[/b]。"

msgid "[b]Hunting Tools[/b] are used automatically during the Hunting process.\n\nBonuses can be applied to specific [b]Hunting Tools[/b] via the [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Shop_64.png[/img] [b]Shop[/b] and other means.\n\nSome animals do not use [b]Hunting Tools[/b]."
msgstr "[b]狩猎工具[/b]会在狩猎过程中自动使用。\n\n可通过 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Shop_64.png[/img] [b]商店[/b] 及其他方式为特定[b]狩猎工具[/b]添附加成。\n\n有些动物不使用[b]狩猎工具[/b]。"

msgid "Hunting is a Skill that tasks you to hunt a variety of wild Animals & Beasts in order to acquire their rewards.\n\nHunting feeds directly into [b]Beastcrafting[/b] as its primary use, while also rewarding you with various other Items such as [b]Herb Seeds[/b] and [b]Bones[/b]"
msgstr "狩猎是一个要求你狩猎各种野生动物与野兽以获取其奖励的技能。\n\n狩猎主要用于[b]兽类制作[/b]，同时也会给予你其他各种物品，如[b]草药种子[/b]和[b]骨头[/b]"

msgid "Step 1 - Surveying\n[ul]Search the location to find the Animal’s tracks.[/ul]\n\nStep 2 - Tracking\n[ul]YFollow the tracks to locate the Animal.[/ul]\n\nStep 3 - Trapping\n[ul]Use your crafted Trap and attempt to catch it.\nFailing sends the Animal fleeing, returning you to Tracking.[/ul]"
msgstr "步骤1 - 勘测\n[ul]搜索该地点以找到动物的足迹。[/ul]\n\n步骤2 - 追踪\n[ul]沿着足迹定位动物。[/ul]\n\n步骤3 - 设陷阱\n[ul]使用你制作的陷阱尝试捕获它。\n失败会让动物逃走，并返回追踪阶段。[/ul]"

msgid "<<<In the once-sweet Citrus Kingdom, the Lemon King rules with a sour fist. A brave adventurer must battle through citrus minions to reach the Lemon Throne. You must defeat the Lemon King and claim the legendary Lemon Sword to consume the Lemon of Power. And consume the Lemon (King?)...>>>"
msgstr "<<<在曾经甜美的柑橘王国里，柠檬王以酸涩的铁腕统治着一切。勇敢的冒险者必须冲破柑橘爪牙的阻挠，抵达柠檬王座。你必须击败柠檬王、夺得传说中的柠檬剑，才能吞噬力量之柠檬。然后吞下那颗柠檬（国王？）……>>>"

msgid "Before you can hunt, you must craft a Trap in Crafting.\n\nEach Animal requires a specific Trap, which is listed in Hunting when you select the Animal.\n\nYou can then hunt the Animal, which is an automatic 3-step process, rewarding you with Skill XP and Items upon successfully trapping the Animal."
msgstr "在狩猎之前，你必须在制作中制作一个陷阱。\n\n每种动物需要特定陷阱，选择动物时会在狩猎界面列出。\n\n然后你就可以狩猎该动物，这是一个自动的三步流程，成功捕获后给予技能经验和物品。"

msgid "[ul]Keep your animals fed every hour.\nReduces by [color=orange]10%[/color] every hour an animal is not fed :(\nReplenish to [color=orange]100%[/color] when fed :D\nSome animals don't need food (Like Sheep or Cows).\nYour animal won't die at [color=orange]0%[/color] [b]Hunger[/b], but my goodness it will be STARVING.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]每小时保持你的动物进食。\n动物未进食时每小时降低 [color=orange]10%[/color] :(\n喂食后恢复至 [color=orange]100%[/color] :D\n有些动物不需要食物（比如羊或牛）。\n你的动物在 [color=orange]0%[/color] [b]饥饿度[/b] 时不会死亡，但天哪，它要饿死了。[/ul]"

msgid "Your [color=#FFD16D]chance to hit[/color] depends on your [color=#FFD16D]Stance's Accuracy[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Evasion[/color] against that same [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color].\n\nWhen fighting an Enemy, aim to have a higher [color=#FFD16D]Accuracy Rating[/color] than their [color=#FFD16D]Evasion Rating[/color]."
msgstr "你的[color=#FFD16D]命中几率[/color]取决于你的[color=#FFD16D]架势命中[/color]与[color=#FFD16D]敌人[/color]对该[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]的闪避的对比。\n\n与敌人战斗时，尽量让你的[color=#FFD16D]命中评级[/color]高于其[color=#FFD16D]闪避评级[/color]。"

msgid "[color=#b5b5b5]Imports the Bank Configuration from the provided base64 string or Cloud code.\n[b][color=orange]Note:[/color][/b] Lock Bank Configuration is automatically enabled when importing.\n[b][color=orange_red]Warning:[/color][/b] This will overwrite your entire existing Bank Configuration. This cannot be undone. Use with caution.[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#b5b5b5]从提供的 base64 字符串或云代码导入库存配置。\n[b][color=orange]注意：[/color][/b] 导入时会自动启用锁定库存配置。\n[b][color=orange_red]警告：[/color][/b] 这将覆盖你现有的全部库存配置。此操作无法撤销。请谨慎使用。[/color]"

msgid "Happy Animals, happy farm.\n[ul]Calculated based on the three other stats.\n[b]Skill XP[/b] & [b]Produce[/b] is multiplied by the Animal's [b]Happiness[/b].\nCannot go below [color=orange]0%[/color].[/ul]\n\n[i]Happiness = Hunger * 0.3 + Comfort * 0.3 + Satisfaction * 0.4[/i]\nNote: [b]Comfort[/b] is [color=green]1[/color] if >= [color=orange]75%[/color]"
msgstr "快乐的动物，快乐的农场。\n[ul]根据其他三项属性计算。\n[b]技能经验[/b]与[b]产出[/b]会乘以动物的[b]幸福度[/b]。\n不会低于 [color=orange]0%[/color]。[/ul]\n\n[i]幸福度 = 饥饿度 * 0.3 + 舒适度 * 0.3 + 满意度 * 0.4[/i]\n注意：若 [b]舒适度[/b] >= [color=orange]75%[/color]，则视为 [color=green]1[/color]"

msgid "Shallow Shores is a popular fishing spot along the coast, known for its abundant Shrimp, Herring, and Lobster. However, the waters are also littered with debris from old shipwrecks, leading to frequent catches of junk alongside the prized fish. Despite the challenge, the tranquil waves and hidden treasures make it a favorite for adventurers and anglers alike."
msgstr "浅滩海岸是沿岸颇受欢迎的钓点，以丰富的虾、鲱鱼和龙虾闻名。然而，这片水域也散落着旧沉船的残骸，因此常在钓到珍贵鱼类的同时也捕到垃圾。尽管有此挑战，平静的波浪与隐藏的宝藏仍使这里成为冒险者和钓鱼爱好者的最爱。"

msgid "Using the [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapon[/color] plus its [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]. For example, using a [u]Bow[/u] requires [u]Arrows[/u] as ammunition primarily obtained from Fletching.\n\nSome [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapons[/color] like [u]Javelins[/u] can be their own [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]."
msgstr "使用[color=#FFD16D]远程战斗风格[/color]需要[color=#FFD16D]远程武器[/color]及其[color=#FFD16D]弹药[/color]。例如，使用[u]弓[/u]需要[u]箭[/u]作为弹药，主要来自制箭。\n\n有些[color=#FFD16D]远程武器[/color]如[u]标枪[/u]可自身作为[color=#FFD16D]弹药[/color]。"

msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapons[/color] have [color=#FFD16D]Elements[/color] attached to them which determine what type of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color] you can use in Combat.\n\nMonsters may also have an [color=#FFD16D]Element[/color], which can either buff or debuff your character.\n\nBeating an Element grants you with [color=green]+15% Max Hit[/color].\nLosing to an Element debuffs you with [color=orange_red]-15% Max Hit[/color].\n\nThis is only applied to you, and never to the Enemy."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]带有[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，决定你在战斗中可使用哪种[color=aqua]魔法咒语[/color]。\n\n怪物也可能带有[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，可强化或削弱你的角色。\n\n克制元素给予你[color=green]+15% 最大伤害[/color]。\n被元素克制则受到[color=orange_red]-15% 最大伤害[/color]的削弱。\n\n这仅作用于你，绝不会作用于敌人。"

msgid "You are tasked to purchase plots of [b]Land[/b] to build [b]Enclosures[/b] and look after various types of [b]Animals[/b].\n\nEach [b]Animal[/b] has a [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] stat that needs to be managed, where your primary goal is to keep this at or above 100%.\n\n[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]Skill XP[/b] and resources are generated every 1 hour, multiplied by [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b]."
msgstr "你的任务是购买[b]土地[/b]地块来建造[b]围栏[/b]并照料各种[b]动物[/b]。\n\n每只[b]动物[/b]都有一个 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b] 数值需要管理，你的主要目标是保持在100%或以上。\n\n[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]技能经验[/b] 和资源每1小时产出一次，并乘以 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]。"

msgid "There are three Combat Styles: [color=#FFD16D]Melee, Ranged[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]. Your equipped [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] determines which style you use.\n\n[color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color]\n\nBeating a Combat Style [color=green]increases your Max Hit by 10%[/color], while losing [color=orange_red]decreases it by 10%[/color]. This is only applied to you, and never the Enemy."
msgstr "共有三种战斗风格：[color=#FFD16D]近战、远程[/color]和[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]。你装备的[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]决定你使用哪种风格。\n\n[color=#FFD16D]近战[/color] 克制 [color=#FFD16D]远程[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]远程[/color] 克制 [color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color] 克制 [color=#FFD16D]近战[/color]\n\n克制某种战斗风格会[color=green]使你的最大伤害提高10%[/color]，被克制则[color=orange_red]降低10%[/color]。这仅作用于你，绝不作用于敌人。"

msgid "Elemental Magic, Arcade Missiles, Dark Conjures, Fairy Dust, Felflame, Ice, Molten Lava Spells and Fire Casts, Earth, Lightning, Shadow Casts, Spells, Crafting, Drop Reagents, Poison, Forge, Harvests, Organic Gathers, Pick Ups, Liquid Touches, Potions, UI, Buttons, Clicks, Transitions, Collect Stone, Rock Items, Hits, Crafting, Cloth, Wood, Armor, Metal, Weapons, Bows, Crossbows, Knifes, Swords, Creature Growls, Grunts, Backpack, Page Turns, Chests, Wooden Levers, Pots, Inventory Taps, Tabs, Buttons, Themed Confirms, Selects, Footsteps,Dirt, Grass, Stone, and Water"
msgstr ""

msgid "Damage from attacks is reduced by a percentage depending on [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n\nYour [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Protection[/color] determines how much of your damage is reduced. Higher [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] helps overcome enemy [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n\n[color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] is primarily obtained from [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color].\n[color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color] is primarily obtained from other gear.\n\nYou can reduce an Enemy's damage dealt to you by increasing your [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color]."
msgstr "攻击伤害会根据[color=#FFD16D]攻击[/color]与[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]按百分比减免。\n\n你的[color=#FFD16D]攻击[/color]与[color=#FFD16D]敌人防护[/color]的对比决定你的伤害被减免多少。更高的[color=#FFD16D]攻击[/color]有助于突破敌人的[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]。\n\n[color=#FFD16D]攻击[/color]主要来自[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]。\n[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]主要来自其他装备。\n\n你可以通过提高自己的[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]来减少敌人对你造成的伤害。"

msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Thank you for joining us during [color=FFD16D]Steam Next Fest[/color]!\n\nMelvor Idle 2 is still in active development, and the version you're about to play is an [color=FFD16D]early limited look at the game[/color]. Many systems, features, visuals, and balance are still being developed and refined as we work towards an Early Access release.\n\nFor this demo, progression is limited to [color=FFD16D]Level 60[/color], with only a limited selection of Skills and content available to test out. The Early Access release will have far more content available!\n\nAs this is an early build, you may encounter unfinished content, balance that isn't quite right, missing features, or bugs.\n\nYour feedback during Next Fest is incredibly valuable to us. We'd love to hear about your experience, any bugs you may have encountered, or general discussions around the game.\n\nMost importantly, have fun, explore, experiment, and enjoy your first steps into Melvor Idle 2!\n\nAnd remember - [color=FFD16D]Melvor Idle 2 is an idle game![/color] You can set your character on a task, let them make progress in the background, and check out some of the other great games taking part in Steam Next Fest. Melvor will be here when you get back!\n\nThank you for being part of the journey![/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs, Coolrox, Prat, Tapi & Ash[/color][/i]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]感谢你在 [color=FFD16D]Steam Next Fest[/color] 期间与我们相聚！\n\n梅尔沃放置2 仍在积极开发中，你即将游玩的版本是[color=FFD16D]游戏的早期有限预览[/color]。在我们迈向抢先体验发布的过程中，许多系统、功能、视觉与平衡仍在开发和打磨。\n\n在此试玩版中，进度限制为 [color=FFD16D]60级[/color]，仅提供有限的技能与内容可供测试。抢先体验版将提供多得多的内容！\n\n由于这是早期版本，你可能会遇到未完成的内容、不太准确的平衡、缺失的功能或错误。\n\n你在 Next Fest 期间的反馈对我们极其宝贵。我们很想听听你的体验、你遇到的任何错误，或关于游戏的一般讨论。\n\n最重要的是，玩得开心，去探索、去实验，享受你踏入 梅尔沃放置2 的第一步！\n\n并记住 —— [color=FFD16D]梅尔沃放置2 是一款放置游戏！[/color] 你可以让角色执行任务、在后台推进进度，同时去看看参加 Steam Next Fest 的其他优秀游戏。你回来时梅尔沃仍在这里！\n\n感谢你参与这段旅程！[/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs、Coolrox、Prat、Tapi 与 Ash[/color][/i]"

