msgid "Azamire is as ready as it ever will be to take down the Ringleader. The old Northern Road is clear, Jass's crew has finished the tunnel to the prison, and you have defeated the worst of the Misty Thicket's roaming guards. Now, all that's left to do is burn the fortress to the ground."
msgstr "阿扎米尔已做好一切准备击败首领。旧北路已畅通，贾斯的队伍已挖通通往监狱的隧道，你也已击溃迷雾密林中最凶悍的巡逻守卫。现在剩下要做的，就是把那座堡垒烧成灰烬。"

