msgstr "升级单个物品的存储空间。"

msgid "Upgrades the output production of the Grain Mill."
msgstr "提升谷物磨坊的产出产量。"

msgid "Used in Cooking."
msgstr "用于烹饪。"

msgid "Used in the creation of Super Combat Potions in Herblore."
msgstr "用于在草药学中制作超级战斗药水。"

msgid "Used to pay Farmhands for Farming Automation."
msgstr "用于支付农场帮工的农耕自动化费用。"

msgid "Useful for Slayer"
msgstr "对讨伐有用"

msgid "Useful items for Skills"
msgstr "技能实用物品"

msgid "Valuable item to be sold."
msgstr "可出售的贵重物品。"

msgid "Very dusty"
msgstr "非常脏"

msgid "View how many decades you have left to reach 100%."
msgstr "查看距离达到 100% 还剩几个十年。"

msgid "We have to get through this gate!"
msgstr "我们必须穿过这道门！"

msgid "We will not fall. Not this time."
msgstr "我们不会倒下。这次不会。"

msgid "While out on a fishing trip, a little girl has gone missing with only her fishing pole and a single tooth left behind. Not much to go on, except one small detail. It isn't a human tooth."
msgstr "一次外出钓鱼时，一个小女孩失踪了，只留下她的钓竿和一颗牙齿。线索不多，只有一个细节：那不是人类的牙齿。"

msgid "Will be removed from the Shop in a future update."
msgstr "将在未来更新中从商店移除。"

msgid "[Companion Name] has been strangely absent lately, and on the rare chance you do see them, they usually quickly excuse themselves. What's going on?"
msgstr "[Companion Name]最近反常地不见踪影，偶尔见到时也总是很快找个借口离开。到底怎么回事？"

msgid "[b]Bandit Encampment[/b]: A brew to put bandits to sleep."
msgstr "[b]强盗营地[/b]：一种能让强盗睡着的药酒。"

msgid "[b]Bandit Encampment[/b]: A pile of fake arrows used to swap in place of real ones."
msgstr "[b]强盗营地[/b]：一堆用来替换真箭的假箭。"

msgid "[b]Capital Marketplace[/b]: Small rune marbles used to slip up pursuers."
msgstr "[b]首都集市[/b]：用来绊倒追兵的小符文弹珠。"

msgid "[b]Capital Marketplace[/b]: Your rare find draws a crowd and hide your other motives."
msgstr "[b]首都集市[/b]：你稀有的发现引来人群，也掩护了你其他的动机。"

msgid "[b]Farmers Market[/b]: Attracts angry Bees."
msgstr "[b]农夫市场[/b]：招来愤怒的蜜蜂。"

msgid "[b]Farmers Market[/b]: Switch nearby fertiliser bags with your very own concoction."
msgstr "[b]农夫市场[/b]：用你自己调制的混合物掉换附近的肥料袋。"

msgid "[b]Lowtown District[/b]: A slimey escape."
msgstr "[b]下城区[/b]：一记黏滑的脱身法。"

msgid "[b]Lowtown District[/b]: A sling to shoot small pebbles at targets."
msgstr "[b]下城区[/b]：用来向目标射小石子的弹弓。"

msgid "[b]Lowtown District[/b]: Attach gold rings on a string to fool thugs."
msgstr "[b]下城区[/b]：把金戒指串在绳子上骗过暴徒。"

msgid "[b]Mage Tower[/b]: Create an unstable & destructive Elemental reaction."
msgstr "[b]法师塔[/b]：制造一场不稳定且破坏性极强的元素反应。"

msgid "[b]Mage Tower[/b]: Enchants books to fly in wizard tower."
msgstr "[b]法师塔[/b]：让书在巫师塔里飞起来的附魔。"

msgid "[b]Seashade Port[/b]: Attracts countless seagulls to help distract nearby folk."
msgstr "[b]海影港[/b]：招来无数海鸥，帮忙分散附近人的注意力。"

msgid "[b]Seashade Port[/b]: Poison Fish to cause panic"
msgstr "[b]海影港[/b]：给鱼下毒以引发恐慌"

msgid "[b][color=orange](ALPHA ONLY)[/color][/b] Will be removed in a future update when a natural source is added."
msgstr "[b][color=orange](仅限 ALPHA)[/color][/b] 将在加入自然来源后的未来更新中移除。"

msgid "[b][color=orange](ALPHA ONLY)[/color][/b] Will be removed in a future update when natural a source is added."
msgstr "[b][color=orange](仅限 ALPHA)[/color][/b] 将在加入自然来源后的未来更新中移除。"

msgid "[color=orange][b](ALPHA TEST ONLY, WILL BE REMOVED)[/b][/color] Purchase this once you have experienced the initial Bank Slot limit as a new player (100). This is an Alpha purchase only that will be removed in the future, in favour of a reworked way of purchasing Bank Slots. Reworked method of purchasing requires more game content before adding."
msgstr "[color=orange][b](仅限 ALPHA 测试，将被移除)[/b][/color] 在你以新玩家身份体验过初始库存槽位上限（100）之后再购买此项。这只是 Alpha 阶段的购买项，未来会被移除，改为重做的库存槽位购买方式。重做后的购买方式需要更多游戏内容才能加入。"

msgid "...Are you forgetting what happened a couple of years ago? I still feel the need to duck every time you-"
msgstr "……你忘了几年前发生的事吗？每次你——我还是忍不住想躲。"

msgid "...No. Honestly, don't think I've ever used much more than a worm, really."
msgstr "……不用了。说实话，除了虫子我真没怎么用过别的。"

msgid "...We'll make them pay, Jass. [Companion Name] and I won't let this go unanswered."
msgstr "……我们会让他们付出代价，贾斯。[Companion Name]和我不会让这件事就这么算了。"

msgid "...[Companion Name]?"
msgstr "……[Companion Name]？"

msgid "...humans. That's what the Ringleader wants from all of the Golbin tribes he subjugates!"
msgstr "……人类。这就是首领从他征服的所有哥布林部落那里要的东西！"

msgid "A couple of people who aren't running for the hills want to fight back. But they're farmers. Builders."
msgstr "有几个人没往山里逃，而是想反击。可他们是农夫，是建筑工。"

msgid "A handful of people you haven't seen before walk past, likely another group of refugees from one of the nearby villages that fared even worse than Azamire, attacked around the same time. The town's new mayor - the son of the previous mayor that was lost in the attack - welcomes them and directs them towards one of the newly repaired buildings that they were using to shelter people before more buildings could be made to house them. Once he wraps up, he sets his eyes on you and [Companion Name]."
msgstr "几个你从没见过的人走过，大概是附近某个遭袭更惨的村子来的又一批难民，他们差不多同时遇袭。镇上的新镇长——在袭击中丧生的前镇长的儿子——迎接他们，并把他们引向一栋刚修好的建筑；在更多房屋建好之前，那里一直用来安置人。忙完后，他看向你和[Companion Name]。"

msgid "A shipment of..."
msgstr "一批货……"

msgid "Actually, yes. Like I said, most of these folks hardly know anything outside of their trade. Showing them how to put together a couple of arrows could go a long way towards making them self-sufficient."
msgstr "其实，是的。就像我说的，这些人除了本行几乎什么都不懂。教他们怎么拼出几支箭，对让他们自给自足大有帮助。"

msgid "Afraid not. Never had the decorum to fit into a role like that. "
msgstr "恐怕不行。我从来没那份体面去担这样的角色。 "

msgid "After that, we head to the gate and hack it down. The archers will keep us covered."
msgstr "之后我们冲到大门口把它砍倒。弓箭手会掩护我们。"

msgid "Ah, [Player Name], you're here. We're planning our path to the fortress, but our scouts ran into a bit of a snag."
msgstr "啊，[Player Name]，你来了。我们正规划通往堡垒的路线，但斥候遇到了点麻烦。"

msgid "Alarms start to sound as the militia's arrows are lit. You clutch your weapon in anticipation, wishing you could to go check on the tunnel to see how Gloob's breakout went, but there's no time. The hillside is lit up with the fires you and [Companion Name] started, and hobgolbins on the wall begin to shoot towards you. But it's too late. Burning arrow after arrow soar up and over the wall, towards where you pointed out the stockpile. No one can see over the wall, so it's tough to tell if anyone is on target until a resounding BOOM make you cover your ears, even from this far away."
msgstr "民兵的箭被点燃时，警报响起。你握紧武器等待，很想跑去隧道看看格鲁布的突袭进展如何，但已经没时间了。山坡被你和[Companion Name]点起的火光照亮，城墙上的大哥布林开始朝你射击。但已经太迟了。一支又一支火箭越过城墙，飞向你指出的那堆物资。没人能看穿城墙，很难判断是否命中，直到一声轰然巨响让你捂住耳朵——即便隔着这么远。"

msgid "Many of the defenders are thrown from the wall entirely, and as you and the militia charge, the swordsmen dispatch the stunned hobgolbins that fell on the wrong side of the wall. Arrows start to fall again, as the fort's guards gather themselves, and they're met with your militia's own volleys."
msgstr "许多守军被整个炸下城墙；当你和民兵冲上去时，剑手们解决了那些掉在墙内侧、还没缓过神的大哥布林。堡垒守卫重整旗鼓，箭雨再次落下，而迎接他们的是你们民兵自己的齐射。"

msgid "All but two of them were to a single weird ent. Way bigger than the rest, and covered in these weird... talismans."
msgstr "除两只以外，其余都折在一个奇怪的树人手里。它比其余的都要大得多，还长满那些怪异的……护符。"

msgid "And forget about keeping it quiet. I know your people have been at this for a while, right? I'm sure moving all this soil is tough."
msgstr "也别指望悄无声息了。我知道你的人干这行有一阵子了，对吧？搬这么多土肯定不轻松。"

msgid "And that is why reading is cool! "
msgstr "这就是读书很酷的原因！ "

msgid "And then they captured you again sometime after the Ringleader took over?"
msgstr "然后在首领接管之后的某个时候，他们又抓住了你？"

msgid "And then we're in. Try to avoid the fire, and head for the Ringleader?"
msgstr "然后我们就进去了。尽量避开火，直奔首领？"

msgid "And why the blazes would they do that?"
msgstr "他们到底为什么要那么做？"

msgid "Anyway. Shall we get to shooting?"
msgstr "总之。我们该开始射箭了吧？"

msgid "As long as [Companion Name] doesn't stick me with an arrow, sure."
msgstr "只要[Companion Name]别把箭扎到我身上就行。"

msgid "As soon as people start escaping down the tunnel, the guards will notice everyone's missing and sound the alarm."
msgstr "一旦有人开始从隧道逃走，守卫就会发现人少了，并拉响警报。"

msgid "As the question leaves your lips, several golems rise from the piles of rock, doubtlessly less than pleased with your explosive intrusion on their turf. They seem quite keen on smashing you into the ground so they can return to their nap."
msgstr "你的问题刚出口，几个魔像就从石堆里站了起来，显然对你用炸药闯入它们的地盘很不高兴。它们似乎很乐意把你砸进地里，好回去继续打盹。"

msgid "As you finish your conversation, the fortress's outer wall comes into view. Gloob and small group of the militia break off and head for the tunnel while the rest of you set up on the hillside just outside. Several braziers are set up, and everyone starts to load them with wood while you and [Companion Name] get to work."
msgstr "谈话结束时，堡垒的外墙出现在视野中。格鲁布和一小队民兵脱离队伍前往隧道，其余人在外面的山坡上就位。几座火盆被架好，大家开始往里面添柴，你和[Companion Name]则开始干活。"

msgid "As you walk back into Azamire, you feel a swell of pride at the number of newly constructed buildings. They're small, and you hardly takes you long to count them on two hands, but still, Azamire is rebuilding, bit by bit."
msgstr "当你走回阿扎米尔，看到新建起来的建筑数量，心中涌起一阵自豪。它们很小，两只手就能数完，但阿扎米尔正在一点一点地重建。"

msgid "Your delight is interrupted by a shriek as you hear a... Golbin run by, chased by the newly appointed Militia Captain - Jass. The chase doesn't last long, and Gloob is held down while Jass berates it, talking about how she's no fool and knows a trap when she sees one."
msgstr "你的欣慰被一声尖叫打断——一只……哥布林跑过，后面追着新任民兵队长贾斯。追逐没持续多久，格鲁布被按住，贾斯训斥它，说自己可不是傻子，一眼就能看出陷阱。"

msgid "As you walk through Azamire, the town is abuzz with nervous energy. Several wagons are lined up and everyone who isn't fighting have come out to wish you well. Hapren approaches, and mentions that the town has gotten together and prepared some combat supplies into the back of one of the carts for you, and hopes that it helps."
msgstr "当你穿过阿扎米尔，小镇里弥漫着紧张的气氛。几辆货车排成一列，所有不参战的人都出来为你送行。哈普伦走过来，说镇上的人凑了些战斗补给放在其中一辆车的后部，希望对你有所帮助。"

msgid "You all set off, and as the sun begins to set, the cold mist of the thicket starts to seep into your clothes. The militia is tense, but ready. There are people to save, and taking out the Ringleader would go a long way towards making everyone safer."
msgstr "你们一同出发。太阳开始西沉，密林里冰冷的雾气渗进衣服。民兵们紧张但准备就绪。有人等着被救，而干掉首领会让大家安全许多。"

msgid "Because if a tribe doesn't pay up with enough people, the Ringleader takes his tithe in other ways. Turns us into ents. "
msgstr "因为如果一个部落交不出足够的人，首领就会用别的方式收取他的份额。把我们变成树人。 "

msgid "Before you lies the broken body of the Ringleader, sickly purple blood spilling from his wounds. You finally spare a glance to those around you, and you realize... it's over. Less than half the attacking force remains, but Azamire's people still stand.  Gloob stands among the militia, deep green body covered in the blue blood of hobgolbins, and he lets out a cheer, one that the remaining militia proudly meet. Jass barks out orders, pointing out wounded with the stump of her arm, then starting to pull one of the wounded towards the gate with her other."
msgstr "首领破碎的身躯躺在你面前，病态的紫色血液从伤口流出。你终于有空看一眼周围的人，然后意识到……结束了。进攻的队伍剩下不到一半，但阿扎米尔的人依然站着。格鲁布站在民兵当中，深绿的身体沾满大哥布林的蓝色血液，他发出一声欢呼，剩下的民兵自豪地应和。贾斯大声下令，用断臂的残端指认伤员，然后用另一只手把一名伤员往大门方向拖。"

msgid "Half a dozen emotions cross [Companion Name]'s face the second you look at them, but most among them all, relief. They embrace you for naught but a moment before heading towards the Ringleader, who barely manages a ragged breath. As you approach, the beast lets out a throaty cackle before it devolves into a choking cough. You ask it two questions. Where did the shipments go, and who are the people it works for?"
msgstr "你一看向[Companion Name]，六七种情绪便掠过他们的脸，其中最浓的是释然。他们只抱了你一瞬，就走向首领——后者勉强喘着一口气。你靠近时，那头野兽发出一阵低沉的怪笑，随后变成窒息的咳嗽。你问它两个问题：那些货去了哪里，以及它在为谁卖命？"

msgid "He just sits and smirks, the flames of his burning fortress dancing in his eyes."
msgstr "它只是坐着冷笑，燃烧堡垒的火光在它眼中跳动。"

msgid "\"They'll come back soon.\""
msgstr "「他们很快就会回来。」"

msgid "Bet you I'll kill more than you. Try not to die."
msgstr "我打赌我杀得比你多。别死了。"

msgid "But for everyone we've lost!"
msgstr "但为了我们失去的每一个人！"

msgid "Come to me. Time for you to die."
msgstr "到我这儿来。你该死了。"

msgid "Didn't figure. Well, would you two mind helping me out with a little project, then?"
msgstr "我还没想好。那么，你们两位愿意帮我做个小项目吗？"

msgid "Don't fret though! I know how to clear it! I just need a bit of help from you."
msgstr "不过别担心！我知道怎么清开它！我只需要你帮点忙。"

msgid "Don't have any qualms with this, Gloob?"
msgstr "你对这事没有顾虑吗，格鲁布？"

msgid "Don't stop running until you hit the gate! "
msgstr "一直跑到大门前，别停下！ "

msgid "Don't suppose either of you would be willing to take over, would you?"
msgstr "我猜你们两位都不太愿意接手吧？"

msgid "Don't worry, we'll do everything that we can."
msgstr "别担心，我们会尽力而为。"

msgid "Doubt many of 'em are left."
msgstr "估计它们剩不下几个了。"

msgid "Doubt they'll survive being turned into ash, don't you think?"
msgstr "你觉得它们变成灰还活得下来吗？"

msgid "Dwelling on everything that happened... Well, that's no good for anyone."
msgstr "老想着发生过的那些事……对谁都没好处。"

msgid "Even your mayor! Sounds like he's going to try and get me set up with a workshop of sorts!"
msgstr "连你们的镇长也是！听起来他想给我弄个工坊之类的！"

msgid "Everyone gathers up the ent parts. They don't seem dangerous anymore, but you do notice that - slowly but surely - they're starting to gain new growth. If you waited long enough, they'd likely become a threat again. The archers help by snapping off new branches and tossing them back into the pile, and occasionally making sure that none have managed to crawl away."
msgstr "大家把树人的残肢收拢起来。它们似乎不再危险了，但你注意到——缓慢却确定地——它们开始长出新芽。如果等得够久，它们很可能再次成为威胁。弓箭手帮忙掰掉新长出的枝条扔回堆里，偶尔确认没有哪块偷偷爬走。"

msgid "Everyone's ready?"
msgstr "大家都准备好了？"

msgid "Everyone, now!"
msgstr "大家，现在！"

msgid "Everything?"
msgstr "全都？"

msgid "Exactly. Can't miss 'em. Big blue fella, covered in every gaudy fabric he fancies."
msgstr "没错。绝不会认错。一个蓝色的大块头，身上披满他喜欢的各种花哨布料。"

msgid "Exactly... There's no easy way to put such a tragedy, huh?"
msgstr "是啊……这样的悲剧，怎么说都很难开口，对吧？"

msgid "FOR AZAMIRE!"
msgstr "为了阿扎米尔！"

msgid "Feels like we're pullin' more junk out of the water than fish."
msgstr "感觉我们从水里捞上来的垃圾比鱼还多。"

msgid "Fool of a man got between me and one of those wretches' beasts. Seemed like he was going to pull through... but then he didn't."
msgstr "一个蠢货挡在我和那些家伙的野兽之间。看样子他本来能挺过来……结果没有。"

msgid "Forgot that I needed to chat with... Hapren! That's right, needed to chat with Hapren."
msgstr "忘了我要跟谁聊聊……哈普伦！对，得跟哈普伦聊聊。"

msgid "Gloob - who is now allowed to freely roam the town after your scouting mission proved his loyalty - fetches you and brings you to Jass's newly constructed 'barracks'. In reality, it was just an enclosed room with some storage for gear and a few targets set up, but it was coming along nicely. Within her office, a map of the surrounding lands was laid out, recently purchased from one of the infrequent caravans that just started to come by once again."
msgstr "自从你的侦察任务证明了他的忠诚，格鲁布现在可以自由在镇上走动。他来找你，把你带到贾斯新建的「兵营」。实际上那只是一间封闭的房间，里面有些装备储物和几个靶子，但已经像模像样了。她的办公室里铺着一张周边地区的地图，是最近从一支重新偶尔路过的商队那里买来的。"

msgid "Gloob gives you the rundown on an idea he's tried before. With a bit of effort, careful chiselling, and sulfur, fire runes could be made into shaped bombs could carefully carve a path through the rockslide. Not only that, he's actually already prepped some runes they traded for, but needs help with the chiselling and then... putting a bit more volatile fire energy into them."
msgstr "格鲁布跟你讲了他以前试过的一个点子。花点功夫，小心凿刻，再加上硫磺，就能把火符文做成定形炸弹，在塌方中小心地开出一条路。不仅如此，他其实已经准备好了换来的符文，但需要人帮忙凿刻，然后……再往里面注入一些更爆裂的火之能量。"

msgid "Gloob starts to run through... more of his social life than you bargained for, and around the twenty minute mark you cough and mention that you really ought to get going to the fortress. Completely oblivious, he wishes you luck, and you set off. Back down at the end of the tunnel, sure enough, Gloob has marked a large cutout for you to follow."
msgstr "格鲁布开始滔滔不绝地讲起……比你预想中多得多的社交生活。大概二十分钟时，你咳了一声，说真的得动身去堡垒了。他完全没察觉，祝你好运，你便出发了。回到隧道尽头，果然，格鲁布已经标好了一大块轮廓让你照着挖。"

msgid "Gods no! No shame to those who are, but those rotters took more than just my hand. Teri... didn't make it."
msgstr "天啊，不！我不轻视那样的人，但那些混蛋夺走的不只是我的手。泰莉……没能活下来。"

msgid "Golbin tooth. The only... blood, that was there was blue, so..."
msgstr "哥布林的牙。那里唯一的……血是蓝色的，所以……"

msgid "Good, good. Azamire can't get much smaller if we want to keep calling ourselves a town. "
msgstr "好，好。如果还想自称是个镇子，阿扎米尔可不能再小下去了。 "

msgid "Good, good. Then, just the two of us are headed out?"
msgstr "好，好。那，就我们两个出去？"

msgid "Hapren brings the two of you over to the center of town, which has been piled with debris from Azamire's cleanup efforts. He talks about how he'd love to throw a little gathering for the town, just so folks can get to know one another and feel a bit of normalcy despite how hard the last while has been. A few people try their best to break down the rubble into movable chunks, but progress is slow, and Hapren asks for help before starting to work on the pile himself."
msgstr "哈普伦把你们俩带到镇中心，那里堆着阿扎米尔清理出来的废墟。他说他很想为镇上办个小聚会，好让大伙互相认识，尽管最近很难熬，也能感到一点正常的生活。几个人正尽力把瓦砾敲成能搬动的块，但进展缓慢；哈普伦开口求助，然后自己也动起手来。"

msgid "Her daughter was out fishing near the river and didn't come home for dinner. Sorry to interrupt your sleep, but I figured you'd want to help."
msgstr "她女儿在河边钓鱼，没回来吃晚饭。抱歉打扰你睡觉，但我想你会愿意帮忙。"

msgid "Hey there, you two. I hope that things have been as good as they can be, considering..."
msgstr "你们好啊。考虑到那些事……希望情况已经尽可能好了。"

msgid "Humans want to be hand delivered to masters?"
msgstr "人类想被亲手送到主人手里？"

msgid "I can't turn my back on Azamire. Too many folks have done too much for me, growing up."
msgstr "我不能背弃阿扎米尔。从小到大，太多人为我付出了太多。"

msgid "I didn't forget your birthday or anything, did I? I'm sorry, okay..?"
msgstr "我没忘记你的生日什么的吧？对不起，好吗……？"

msgid "I didn't want to bring you in case... It had something we couldn't handle."
msgstr "我不想带你去，万一……碰上我们应付不来的东西。"

msgid "I got the idea for these bombs after reading about a wizard that was banished from her family for blowing up half her estate. Tough luck, right?"
msgstr "我是在读到一位法师因为炸掉自家一半庄园而被逐出家门之后，才有了这些炸弹的点子。运气真差，对吧？"

msgid "I haven't shown them how I usually tie my hooks yet, I really-"
msgstr "我还没教他们我平时怎么绑钩子，我真的——"

msgid "I hope that folks aren't giving you too much trouble around town, are they?"
msgstr "希望镇上的人没给你添太多麻烦吧？"

msgid "I just wanted to see it! I've been practicing on the smaller ones all this time."
msgstr "我只是想看看！我一直都在小的那些身上练习。"

msgid "I made a lot of contacts when I was traveling about. We'd have to trade for it."
msgstr "我四处游历时结识了不少人脉。我们得换回来才行。"

msgid "I might be green, but I'm no Golbin. Let's take him out."
msgstr "我虽然是绿的，但我可不是哥布林。我们干掉他。"

msgid "I see that things are going well."
msgstr "看来事情进展顺利。"

msgid "I should... be a little more careful with fire spells in the future."
msgstr "以后我该……对火焰法术更小心一点。"

msgid "I take it you're leaving, then? Can't blame you, but this is home for the both of us. Even if... Home's looking a little worse for wear."
msgstr "那么，我猜你要走了？不能怪你，但这里是我们两个的家。即使……家看起来有点破败。"

msgid "I told you that when you saved me from that group days ago!"
msgstr "几天前你从那伙人手里救我的时候我就告诉你了！"

msgid "I used to be pretty good with a bow, but it'd be a bit tough with this hand... or lack thereof."
msgstr "我以前挺擅长用弓的，但用这只手就有点难了……或者说，没手了。"

msgid "I'm... little. Never been useful for much, the other Golbins said. Too 'so-fist-uh-cated', they'd say."
msgstr "我……个子小。别的哥布林说我从来没什么用。他们会说太「有学问」了。"

msgid "I..."
msgstr "我……"

msgid "I... I couldn't put you in danger, [Player Name]."
msgstr "我……我不能让你陷入危险，[Player Name]。"

msgid "If I couldn't see them swimming around, I'd swear the stock of fish had run dry."
msgstr "要不是能看见它们游来游去，我发誓这河里已经没鱼了。"

msgid "If everyone's ready, let's head out to the river, then?"
msgstr "如果大家都准备好了，那我们就去河边？"

msgid "If it goes all the way down to stone, I wouldn't even know how start trying to get through the stone. I'm no rockhound."
msgstr "如果一直通到石头层，我根本不知道该怎么试图穿过石头。我可不是什么岩石行家。"

msgid "If this ambush goes well, they won't need to fight much. Just need to look scary and grab one of two of the Golbins to tell us where they brought the girl."
msgstr "如果这次伏击顺利，他们不需要打多少。只要看起来够吓人，再抓一两个哥布林问出他们把女孩带到哪了。"

msgid "If you didn't... I probably would have. I don't want to lose you either."
msgstr "如果不是你……我大概早就去了。我也不想失去你。"

msgid "If you were doing something dangerous, then I especially should have been there!"
msgstr "如果你在做危险的事，那我就更该在场！"

msgid "It's a start, though. And besides, keeping these people busy is just as important as making sure they're trained."
msgstr "不过这是个开始。再说，让这些人有事做，和确保他们受过训练同样重要。"

msgid "It's always good to practice caution! Shall we get back to bombing the crap out of this canyon now?"
msgstr "谨慎一点总是好的！我们现在回去把这峡谷炸个底朝天吧？"

msgid "It's anyone's guess how many Golbins there will be. It'd be smart to let them come to us."
msgstr "会有多少哥布林谁也说不准。让他们来找我们比较聪明。"

msgid "Jass, you sure about this?"
msgstr "贾斯，你确定吗？"

msgid "Jass... A moment?"
msgstr "贾斯……能等一下吗？"

msgid "Just kinda... press it into the wood and it'll activate. I've marked the hole you need to cut in red paint, okay?"
msgstr "就这样……把它按进木头里，它就会启动。我用红漆标好了你要凿的洞，好吗？"

msgid "Just please... hurry. I'm hopeful my little Ana is safe, but... it's not like they took her for a fun little stroll around the woods. I know she must be so frightened..."
msgstr "请你……快点。我希望我的小安娜没事，可是……他们带她走可不像是去林子里开心散步。我知道她一定吓坏了……"

msgid "Just... you and me, clearing a rockslide? How well can you swing a pick?"
msgstr "就……你和我，清理一场塌方？你挥镐挥得怎么样？"

msgid "Keep the rest of them off [Player Name] and [Companion Name]! "
msgstr "别让其他人靠近[Player Name]和[Companion Name]！ "

msgid "Know that we fight not just for those back home, not just to save yourselves..."
msgstr "要知道，我们不只为家乡的人而战，也不只为救自己而战……"

msgid "Late in the evening, you head to the recently built home for [Companion Name]. It's nothing fancy - like most of the new constructions in Azamire - but all of the folks who've been contributing the most were given priority in separate lodgings, and they've done wonders for bringing back a bit of normalcy."
msgstr "傍晚时分，你前往[Companion Name]新近建成的住处。不怎么起眼——和阿扎米尔大多数新建筑一样——但所有出力最多的人都优先分到了独立住所，这些对恢复一点正常生活起了很大作用。"

msgid "What hasn't been normal is how little you've seen [Companion Name] lately. You've had plenty of times where you weren't attached at the hip over the years you've known one another, but you know they've been around. It almost feels as if they've been avoiding you."
msgstr "不正常的是一直很少见到[Companion Name]。相识这些年，你们也有过不黏在一起的时候，但你知道他们就在附近。几乎感觉像在躲着你。"

msgid "You knock several times to no avail. Just as you turn to go, you see a limping figure approach, notice you, and then turn away."
msgstr "你敲了好几次门都没人应。正要转身离开时，你看见一个跛行的身影走近，注意到你，然后又转过身去。"

msgid "Let's get this done."
msgstr "把这事干完吧。"

msgid "Let's say ten bars even."
msgstr "就算十锭整吧。"

msgid "Make sure to leave a couple breathing!"
msgstr "记得留几个活口！"

msgid "Makes sense. So, you need to get through this wall. Any ideas?"
msgstr "有道理。那么，你需要穿过这堵墙。有什么想法？"

msgid "Many of the folks picked up your teaching pretty quickly. Even Jass, just managing with a single hand, did a fine job putting together some flight-worthy arrows. [Companion Name]'s lesson seemed to go about as smoothly, and they produced a few bows to share amongst themselves for the next bout of training. The villagers quietly, but excitedly, show off what they managed to make, or laugh about how poorly their creations turned out, depending on their results."
msgstr "很多人都很快掌握了你的教学。就连只剩一只手的贾斯，也把几支能飞的箭做得不错。[Companion Name]的课似乎也同样顺利，他们做出几把弓，分给大家在下一轮训练中使用。村民们安静却兴奋地展示自己做成的成果，或者根据成效，为自己做得有多糟而大笑。"

msgid "Me too."
msgstr "我也是。"

msgid "Never better. Plan is the same, still?"
msgstr "再好不过了。计划还是照旧？"

msgid "No clue! But it got me thinking about what happens when magic goes wrong, you know?"
msgstr "完全不知道！但这让我开始想魔法出错时会怎样，你懂吧？"

msgid "No no, I have something far better."
msgstr "不不，我有更好的东西。"

msgid "No one is hurt. But a bit of the Old Northern Road that passes through the Foggy Canyon has been buried under a rock slide. "
msgstr "没人受伤。但穿过雾峡谷的那段旧北路被塌方埋住了。 "

msgid "No! I even traded with some of your people up north. I would make stuff, then sell it for books. I learned lots."
msgstr "不！我甚至和你们北边的人做过交易。我会做些东西，然后卖掉换书。我学到了很多。"

msgid "No, I've just been..."
msgstr "不，我只是……"

msgid "Not a single person falters as they stream past you, charging with weapons and heads held high. You don't turn away as you see some being driven through as the Ringleader's forces crash into your own. Time slows as you push through, trusting your people to keep you safe. As you make it through the bodies, the Ringleader stands with a gnarled smirk, holding what must be half a burning tree as its weapon, seemingly unbothered by the flames that flicker up its arm."
msgstr "当他们从你身边涌过、举着武器昂首冲锋时，没有一个人退缩。当首领的部队撞进你的人群，你看着有人被刺穿，却没有移开视线。你向前推进时，时间仿佛变慢，你把安全托付给自己的人。穿过遍地尸体，首领扭曲地冷笑着站在那里，手里握着的想必是半棵燃烧的树，火光在它手臂上跳动，它却似乎毫不在意。"

msgid "You hear people roar in the battle behind you, some in victory, others... likely as their last act of defiance against the opposing force. You steel yourself and step forward, challenging the Ringleader."
msgstr "你听见身后的战场传来吼声，有些是胜利的欢呼，另一些……大概是他们对敌人最后的抗争。你稳住心神，迈步上前，向首领发起挑战。"

msgid "Not at all, actually. Maybe a couple weird looks here and there, sure, but they've been more than welcoming."
msgstr "其实完全没有。可能偶尔会有几个奇怪的眼神，但他们已经非常友善了。"

msgid "Not much of it."
msgstr "不太清楚。"

msgid "Not sure how far down the wall goes, but we can't just dig down further."
msgstr "不知道这墙有多深，但我们不能再往下挖了。"

msgid "Of course we are. You're coming too, obviously. Unless you want to see me floating by, next?"
msgstr "当然。你显然也要来。除非你想下一个飘过去的是我？"

msgid "Of course! It actually seems that some of the rocks are already moving out of the way in fear, should be a bit less to handle."
msgstr "当然！而且看来有些石头已经吓得自己挪开了，要处理的东西应该会少一点。"

msgid "Of course. It'll be important for us to not get caught out like this again."
msgstr "当然。重要的是我们别再这样被人打个措手不及。"

msgid "Oh Jass... I'm so sorry."
msgstr "哦，贾斯……我很抱歉。"

msgid "Oh and I'm really starting to grow on Jass, and [Companion Name] is having me do a few things around, and also..."
msgstr "哦，而且贾斯开始越来越喜欢我了，[Companion Name]还让我帮忙做些事，还有……"

msgid "Oh? Is everyone alright?"
msgstr "哦？大家都还好吗？"

msgid "Ohhhh..! Hello there, ol' buddy ol' pal. I'm just... gonna, go... this way..."
msgstr "哦哦哦……！你好啊，老伙计老朋友。我就……走……这边……"

msgid "Okay okay... You too, alright? Promise?"
msgstr "好好好……你也是，好吗？答应我？"

msgid "Okay, fine, [Player Name] can do the teaching, maybe I'll learn something too. Is there anything else that I could help with?"
msgstr "好吧，那就[Player Name]来教，说不定我也能学点东西。还有什么我能帮忙的吗？"

msgid "Once that happens, archers will try to hit that stockpile you mentioned with flaming arrows."
msgstr "一旦那边得手，弓箭手就会用火箭射你说的那堆物资。"

msgid "One of the Golbin's fancied himself a knight and wanted to use me as a squire. Carry his weapons n' stuff."
msgstr "有只哥布林自以为是骑士，想让我当他的侍从。给他扛武器之类的。"

msgid "Or... Even worse, it could come down while people are travelling through. "
msgstr "或者……更糟的是，它可能在人通过的时候塌下来。 "

msgid "Please, don't do something like that again, okay? I need you too."
msgstr "拜托，别再干那种事了，好吗？我也需要你。"

msgid "Promise."
msgstr "我保证。"

msgid "Ringleader need new stock, others just ran out."
msgstr "首领需要新货，其他的都用完了。"

msgid "Rough day?"
msgstr "今天不好过？"

msgid "SHE'S GOING TO EAT ME, PLEASE HELP!"
msgstr "她要吃了我，救命！"

msgid "Seems the trees aren't quite 'dead' yet, huh?"
msgstr "看来这些树还没完全「死透」，是吧？"

msgid "Should deal with most of the ents inside, and make a ton of noise. You'll be providing the fire, of course, we need several braziers lit."
msgstr "应该能解决里面大部分树人，还会弄出很大动静。当然，火由你来点，我们需要点着几个火盆。"

msgid "Shouldn't be hard to break up and move, but if the canyon walls keep collapsing, we'll hardly have a road left here at all."
msgstr "敲碎搬走应该不难，但如果峡谷壁继续塌，这条路就基本不剩什么了。"

msgid "Since we're just about done here... While we get things set up, would you mind lending them a hand?"
msgstr "既然这边快弄完了……我们准备的时候，你介意去帮他们一把吗？"

msgid "So you tried to fight it on your own? [Companion Name] why-"
msgstr "所以你想自己去跟它打？[Companion Name]，你为什么不——"

msgid "So... You've never even hurt a person?"
msgstr "所以……你从来没伤过人？"

msgid "So... what happened?"
msgstr "所以……发生了什么？"

msgid "Something about needing a creature's lifeforce. But I wasn't even ever part of that tribe, I got outcast from my own years ago."
msgstr "说是需要某种生物的生命力。可我从来都不属于那个部落，多年前我就被自己人赶出来了。"

msgid "Something must be going on up river, this is just odd."
msgstr "上游一定出了什么事，这太反常了。"

msgid "Stay safe, everyone."
msgstr "大家注意安全。"

msgid "Ten it is."
msgstr "就十锭。"

msgid "Thank you two for all of this, by the way."
msgstr "顺便说，谢谢你们两位做的这一切。"

msgid "Thank you, Gloob. This is really helpful. I know it might feel a bit odd helping us humans out, but I just wanted to let you know that we appreciate your help."
msgstr "谢谢你，格鲁布。这真的帮了大忙。我知道帮我们人类做事可能让你觉得有点别扭，但我只是想让你知道，我们很感激你的帮助。"

msgid "Thank you... I'm sorry I tried to play the hero."
msgstr "谢谢你……对不起，我本想逞英雄。"

msgid "Thankfully, it shouldn't take you too long to get through with this."
msgstr "幸好，用这个你应该不用太久就能穿过去。"

msgid "Thankfully, no. Jass has been making a bit of progress with her 'militia' and they want to join us."
msgstr "幸好没有。贾斯带着她的「民兵」取得了些进展，他们想加入我们。"

msgid "That I didn't want to lose you too!"
msgstr "我不想连你也失去！"

msgid "That I had to keep Azamire safe and if I brought you with me, you might not come back!"
msgstr "我得保住阿扎米尔，如果带上你，你可能就回不来了！"

msgid "That'd be great, but this is the only feasible way to bring wagons up to the fortress. We'll need them to carry gear, and... wounded, after the battle."
msgstr "那当然好，但这是把货车运到堡垒那边唯一可行的办法。我们需要它们运送装备，还有……战后的伤员。"

msgid "That's right. The tunnel under the prison is ready to get the prisoners out, and we'll have people posted at the exit."
msgstr "没错。监狱下方的隧道已经可以用来救出囚犯了，我们会在出口安排人手。"

msgid "That's what did this to you?"
msgstr "就是那东西把你弄成这样？"

msgid "The cinders from the assault on Azamire have only just fizzled out, much like many of the survivors' will to go on. Everyone that remained had lost something. Their homes. Family members. Friends. You and [Companion Name] sit on the soot covered cobbles that once made up the town's main thoroughfare, watching another family carry what little they have left and shuffle out of town, hoping that some nearby village may have been spared. Neither of you blame them."
msgstr "袭击阿扎米尔的余烬才刚熄灭，就像许多幸存者继续活下去的意志一样。留下的人都失去了些什么。家园。亲人。朋友。你和[Companion Name]坐在铺满煤渣的鹅卵石上——这里曾是镇上的主街——看着又一家人带着仅剩的一点东西，拖着脚步离开小镇，指望附近的某个村子逃过一劫。你们都不怪他们。"

msgid "A woman with a bloodied stump where her hand should have been approaches the two of you and falls to the ground beside you with a sigh."
msgstr "一个女人走过来，本该是手的位置只剩血淋淋的残端；她在你们身旁坐到地上，叹了口气。"

msgid "The ents are all down, and the archers do their best to shoot the talismans out of the trees incase they do... anything bad. [Companion Name] holds their bow at their side, pleased to have gotten a little payback, then kicks at an ent's branch that seems to be trying to crawl away."
msgstr "树人都倒下了，弓箭手尽力把树上的护符射掉，以防它们……做出什么坏事。[Companion Name]把弓垂在身侧，为讨回了一点公道而满意，随后踢了一脚一根似乎想爬走的树人枝条。"

msgid "The folks take up their new weapons eagerly. Though it has only been a short time since Jass gathered them, the combined militia now totaled a couple dozen. You notice as you hand out swords, though most don't have any conventional fighting experience, these people tend to lean capable. Lumber Workers and farmers who've built functional bodies through years of hard labour. Against a trained fighting force, sure, they'd hardly stand a chance. But against a group of ragtag Golbins? You like their odds."
msgstr "人们热切地拿起新武器。虽然贾斯召集他们没多久，这支合并起来的民兵已有二十来人。分发刀剑时你注意到，尽管大多数人没有任何正规战斗经验，这些人却多半相当能干——伐木工和农夫，多年辛苦劳作练出了实用的身体。对上训练有素的军队，他们确实几乎毫无胜算；但对上一群乱七八糟的哥布林？你觉得他们胜算不错。"

msgid "The girl is okay, at least for now, I'd imagine."
msgstr "那女孩没事，至少我想目前是这样。"

msgid "The golems now lay crushed at your feet. Gloob held his own well, using his speed to distract them and a few carefully placed bombs to take out a few of his own. As the two of you catch your breath, one of the walls of the canyon cracks and Gloob jumps back and wraps himself around your leg in fear. A massive sheet of stone falls to the ground in front of you. After the dust settles, Gloob removes himself from your leg and clears his throat while dusting himself off."
msgstr "魔像如今被砸碎在你脚下。格鲁布表现很好，用速度分散它们注意，又用几枚精心放置的炸弹自己解决了几个。你们俩喘气时，峡谷的一面墙裂开了，格鲁布吓得往后一跳，抱住了你的腿。一大片石头砸在你面前的地上。尘埃落定后，格鲁布从你腿上下来，清了清喉咙，拍了拍身上的灰。"

msgid "The guards have wood for brains! You'll see what I mean!"
msgstr "那些守卫脑子是木头做的！你会明白我什么意思！"

msgid "The last bit of smoke goes out as the final pile of burning ent runs out of fuel. You were almost tempted to start trying to grill something, but the idea of the smoke being evil and getting into the food dissuaded any attempts. [Companion Name] leans against you, both for comfort, and because they are far from recovered from their wounds. You tease them lightly about getting smacked around by kindling, to which they reply by driving the butt of their bow into your foot. You tussel their hair and give them a hug, and tell them that you're glad they're safe."
msgstr "最后一堆燃烧的树人耗尽燃料，最后一丝烟也散去了。你差点动了烤点东西的念头，但想到那烟是邪恶的、会钻进食物里，就打消了任何尝试。[Companion Name]靠在你身上，既为寻求安慰，也因为伤势远未痊愈。你轻轻取笑他们被柴火揍了一顿，他们则用弓尾敲了一下你的脚。你揉了揉他们的头发，抱住他们，说你很高兴他们平安无事。"

msgid "The moon was completely hidden by clouds on the night you found yourself outside of the Ringleader's fortress, yet again. The scouting trips had gotten more frequent, though you only had time to go on a few of them lately. But Jass hadn't brought you out for a scouting mission, this time. The two of you wait for a patrol to pass and she brings you to the covered end of a tunnel. You two climb in and follow it for a while, until hitting what must be the wooden wall of the fortress. Gloob is crouched down here, inspecting the wall, not needing any light to see it clearly."
msgstr "那天夜里，你又来到了首领堡垒外，月亮被云完全遮住。侦察越来越频繁，尽管你最近只来得及参加几次。但这次贾斯带你出来不是为了侦察。你们等一队巡逻过去，她把你带到一条隧道的遮蔽尽头。两人爬进去走了一阵，直到撞上想必是堡垒的木墙。格鲁布蹲在那儿检查墙面，不需要任何光源就能看得很清楚。"

msgid "The occasional pained grunt, or worse, the painted gurgles of someone who was struck somewhere lethal, dampen your mood. You knew people would fall today. You can only imagine how the people on the hillside are faring. Just as your mind starts to lose focus, thinking about those you'd lose, you see a burning light at the end of your axe. As you pull it back, you realize you're through! You give a cheer that turns into a battlecry, and your group follows suit. A few more axe strikes and enough holes are opened to let Azamire's troops push through the gate."
msgstr "偶尔的痛哼，或者更糟的、被击中要害的人那种带血泡的咕噜声，都让你的心情沉下去。你知道今天会有人倒下。你只能想象山坡上的人过得怎样。就在思绪开始飘散、想着可能失去谁时，你看见斧头前端透出火光。你把斧头抽回，意识到——穿过去了！你发出一声欢呼，随即变成战吼，你的队伍也跟着喊起来。再砍几下，打开了足够多的缺口，让阿扎米尔的队伍从大门推了进来。"

msgid "The fort grounds are... hellish. Most of the ent guardians already crawl on the ground, crying out with groaning wails as they burn, with nearly every structure already completely engulfed in flames. You wonder for a moment if there's even a point of being inside until a massive blue Golbin covered in singed fabric cries out as he locks eyes with you. The rest of the fort's surviving defenders stand in the middle of the blazing stronghold with the Ringleader, smashing weapons against their shields, waiting for orders. "
msgstr "堡垒的庭院……如同地狱。大部分树人守卫已经在地上爬行，燃烧着发出凄厉的哀嚎，几乎所有建筑都已被火焰完全吞没。有一瞬间你在想进来到底有没有意义，直到一个披着烧焦布料的巨大蓝色哥布林与你对上目光，发出一声咆哮。堡垒其余幸存的守军与首领一同站在火光冲天的要塞中央，用武器敲打盾牌，等待命令。 "

msgid "The sides of the Foggy Canyon hold once you and Gloob finish up hammering the bolts into its walls. Even as you finish up blowing up the last of the rock that remains along the old Northern Road, your handiwork holds, and after you've finished your work, you no longer fear having a sheet of stone land on your head. You look down to the little Golbin by your hand who beams with pride at a job well done, ecstatic to have been able to put his mind to something and see something tangible come out. The two of you head back to Azamire to report a job well done, and that the Northern Road is clear to use once again."
msgstr "你和格鲁布把岩栓敲进峡谷壁之后，雾峡谷的两侧撑住了。即便你炸掉旧北路沿线最后一块岩石时，你的手艺依然牢靠；完工之后，你再也不用担心会有大片石头砸到头上。你低头看向手边的小哥布林，他为干得漂亮而满面自豪，因为终于能把自己的头脑用在某件事上、并看到实实在在的成果而欣喜若狂。你们俩返回阿扎米尔报告任务完成，北路也已重新畅通。"

msgid "The three of you chat back and forth for a while, putting together the idea of a lesson plan, putting up some ramshackle targets meant to resemble a humanoid figure, and some scavenged gear. Jass brings back a dozen or so dusty villagers from town who seem to carry a wide range of emotions. Some, determined to fight back against the cloaked figures who destroyed the town, some who looked lost and aimless, and some somewhere in between."
msgstr "你们三个来回聊了一阵，一起想出一套教学方案，竖起几个勉强像人形的破靶子，还有些捡来的装备。贾斯从镇上带回十几个灰头土脸的村民，他们的情绪各不相同。有的决心反抗那些毁掉小镇的斗篷人，有的看起来茫然无措，还有的介于两者之间。"

msgid "[Companion Name] takes half of them and gets to work showing them how to make bows, something they were always better at than actually firing them, while you take the other half and get to work showing them how to make arrows."
msgstr "[Companion Name]带走一半人，开始教他们怎么做弓——这始终是他们比射箭更擅长的本事；你带走另一半，开始教他们怎么做箭。"

msgid "The town still is, though."
msgstr "不过小镇还是在这儿。"

msgid "Then it seems we should just find another path, no?"
msgstr "那看来我们该另找一条路，不是吗？"

msgid "Then we've got to support the walls, yeah? I... haven't read much on building stuff like that, yet."
msgstr "那我们就得把墙撑住，对吧？我……关于这种建造的事还没读过多少。"

msgid "There really isn't. You inherited quite the mess, didn't you?"
msgstr "确实没有。你继承的摊子可真够乱的，对吧？"

msgid "They detail the events of the night. How they came across the creature, and the talismans in its branches flashed with a bright blue light as they tried to run away. How they floated up into the air and were sucked towards the ent while they flailed about in the air, and then how the ent sent them flying after the talismans in its branches flashed bright blue. [Companion Name] was sure they were going to die, until they saw that the talismans in the ent's branches matched the similar charms forming a line in the nearby treeline. The giant ent shuffled back and forth at that line, but wouldn't cross it. Then, they limped all the way back to Azamire."
msgstr "他们讲述了那晚的经过：如何遇到那个生物，在他们想逃走时，它枝干上的护符闪出亮蓝的光；如何漂浮到空中、在空中挣扎着被吸向那个树人；然后在护符亮起蓝光之后，树人如何把他们甩飞出去。[Companion Name]确信自己要死了，直到发现那树人枝上的护符与附近林线上一串相似符咒排成一线相互对应。那巨大树人在那条线前来回踱动，却不肯越过。之后，他们一路跛行回了阿扎米尔。"

msgid "After a through amount of ridicule and chastisement, you hug them and tell them you're glad they're okay."
msgstr "在好一通数落和责备之后，你抱住他们，说你很高兴他们没事。"

msgid "In the morning you detail everything that happened to Jass, who gathers up the archers of her militia and send them out with you and a wounded [Companion Name], who leads you to the grove with the giant ent. It seems that it has been joined by several of the smaller ones, but you aren't dissuaded. "
msgstr "早上，你把发生的一切详细告诉贾斯；她召集民兵中的弓箭手，让他们与你以及带伤的[Companion Name]一同出发——由后者带你们去那棵巨大树人所在的林子。看来已有几个较小的树人加入了它，但你没有退缩。 "

msgid "They got a long way to go, but they know enough to hold their own. I'm not sending them in to die, don't worry."
msgstr "他们要学的还很多，但已经懂得足以自保。我不是送他们去送死，别担心。"

msgid "They might not have much experience, but the folks that couldn't hit the broad side of a barn - or just otherwise hated trying to use the bows - I've had running drills with sticks and leftover tools."
msgstr "他们也许经验不多，但那些连谷仓正面都打不中的人——或者单纯讨厌用弓的人——我拿棍子和剩下的工具带他们练过跑动。"

msgid "They stop their protesting as you grab their shoulder and pull them behind you. You know from all your time together they'd never really let you go by yourself, but as they grumble behind you, it's clear they're not pleased about running off to find... whatever is, up river."
msgstr "你抓住他们的肩膀，把他们拉到身后，他们便不再抗议。相处这么久，你知道他们绝不会真的让你一个人去；但听着他们在身后嘟囔，显然并不乐意跑去上游找……不管那是什么。"

msgid "After a few minute jaunt upstream, you see it. A massive boar standing over a group of dead Golbins. It pulls against ropes that had been tied to trees along the river, and then thrown over the top of the beast. As you approach it catches sight of you both, assumes and breaks the last of its restrains as it charges towards you!"
msgstr "溯流而上走了几分钟，你看到了它。一头巨大的野猪站在一群死去的哥布林之上。它奋力挣着绑在河边树上、又抛过它背脊的绳索。你靠近时，它看见了你们俩，随即绷紧身体，挣断最后几道束缚，朝你们冲了过来！"

msgid "They were going to tie me up and try to put me in one of the shipments, too, since I wanted to 'act like a human'. "
msgstr "因为我想「像人类一样行事」，他们还打算把我绑起来，塞进某批货里。 "

msgid "Things are going to get really hectic once this starts."
msgstr "一旦开始，事情会变得非常混乱。"

msgid "This beast, is trying to get us to sneak into its boss's hideout tonight. Says all the Golbins will be out escorting a shipment."
msgstr "这头野兽想让我们今晚潜入它老大的藏身处。它说所有哥布林都会出去护送一批货。"

msgid "This group has a long way to go, still. We had guards, but they lasted all of a few minutes before those things started cutting through the town."
msgstr "这帮人还差得远。我们本来有守卫，可那些东西冲进镇子时，他们只撑了几分钟。"

msgid "Together! Go! Now! Kill them all!"
msgstr "一起上！走！现在！全杀了！"

msgid "Tonight, I figured that I could get a look at the big one, learn what it could do, come back to town, and come up with a plan against it."
msgstr "今晚我本来打算去看一眼那个大家伙，摸清它的本事，再回镇上想个对付它的计划。"

msgid "Wait, what does this have to do with reading?"
msgstr "等等，这跟读书有什么关系？"

msgid "Wait, you're using Mackerel Bait, right? Only way I've managed to pull anything out of there."
msgstr "等等，你用的是鲭鱼饵吧？那是我唯一能从里面钓出东西的办法。"

msgid "Wait."
msgstr "等等。"

msgid "Want us to show them the ropes? Been a little while since I shot a bow, but I can show a couple of farmers where to point it and how not to shoot their friends."
msgstr "要我们教他们点门道吗？我射弓有阵子没练了，但我能教几个农夫该往哪儿瞄、怎么别射到自己人。"

msgid "We can do this! Push on!"
msgstr "我们做得到！继续推进！"

msgid "We don't even have knights. But everyone thought it was funny, so they let him until it was going to be time to lump me in with a shipment."
msgstr "我们根本没有骑士。但大家都觉得好笑，就一直由着他，直到要把我塞进货里的时候。"

msgid "We lost so much in the attack, but at least... I still had you. I couldn't lose you, too."
msgstr "那次袭击让我们失去太多，但至少……我还有你。我不能再失去你。"

msgid "We'll do no such thing! We ought to string you up for what your little pack did to Ana!"
msgstr "我们才不会！就凭你那一伙对安娜做的事，我们该把你吊起来！"

msgid "We'll need some rock bolts, which we can make out of steel, then we drive them into the walls."
msgstr "我们需要一些岩栓，可以用钢做，然后把它们打进墙里。"

msgid "We're keeping you here because you were meant to help us, beast!"
msgstr "我们把你留在这里，是因为你本该帮我们，野兽！"

msgid "We've already lost twenty more people on the route to the Ringleader's fortress in the past couple weeks."
msgstr "过去几周，我们在通往首领堡垒的路线上又损失了二十多人。"

msgid "Well, Gloob says he can get a tool to get through it... Right Gloob?"
msgstr "嗯，格鲁布说他有办法弄到穿过它的工具……对吧格鲁布？"

msgid "Well, they typically deal in silver bars. I think it'd usually be about seven or eight bars, but this tool is special item."
msgstr "嗯，他们一般用银锭交易。平常大概七八锭，但这工具是特殊物品。"

msgid "Well, uh... That's certainly not great."
msgstr "嗯，呃……那确实不太妙。"

msgid "Well, you don't need it, but it sure doesn't hurt."
msgstr "嗯，你不需要它，但有了肯定不坏。"

msgid "Well. You two headed out as well?"
msgstr "那么。你们俩也要出发了吗？"

msgid "What I said was true! You should be able to sneak into the Ringleader's fortress at night, it'd be fine!"
msgstr "我说的都是真的！你们夜里应该能潜进首领的堡垒，没问题的！"

msgid "What do you have in mind, exactly?"
msgstr "你具体有什么打算？"

msgid "What do you mean, saved you?"
msgstr "你说救了你，是什么意思？"

msgid "What do you mean, you couldn't put me in danger?"
msgstr "你说不能让我陷入危险，是什么意思？"

msgid "What if we set the same scene as... the incident, have have Jass's people waiting for them?"
msgstr "如果我们把……那件事的场面重现，让贾斯的人在那儿等着他们，怎么样？"

msgid "What were you thinking?"
msgstr "你在想什么？"

msgid "What would you... contacts, want?"
msgstr "你的……人脉，会想要什么？"

msgid "What's happening, exactly?"
msgstr "到底发生了什么？"

msgid "Why are the rocks moving?"
msgstr "为什么石头在动？"

msgid "Why were you in the group that attacked us, then?"
msgstr "那你为什么在袭击我们的队伍里？"

msgid "With the help of some villagers and their carts, you manage to bring back the Golbin's pet taming project. Hapren is shocked, then pleased, as he realizes that this is a far better catch than a few fish from the river."
msgstr "在一些村民和他们的推车帮助下，你们把哥布林那项「驯宠计划」带了回来。哈普伦先是震惊，随后欣喜，因为他意识到这可比河里钓几条鱼强得多。"

msgid "As the sun sets, the wooden debris from the square is burnt and thick slabs of boar are grilled and given out to everyone in attendance. More and more curious folks poke their heads into the square and are met with warmth and light conversation.  A few folks even start up with light songs as the night progresses and Azamire's paltry stores of booze are enjoyed by those who indulge."
msgstr "太阳落山时，广场上的木质残骸被点燃，厚厚的野猪肉块被烤好分给到场的每一个人。越来越多好奇的人探头进广场，迎接他们的是温暖和轻松的交谈。夜色渐深，几个人甚至轻声唱起歌来，阿扎米尔那点微薄的存酒也被愿意喝的人享用着。"

msgid "Azamire's attack is far from forgotten, but this quiet moment amongst the survivors does well to begin healing the towns aching wounds."
msgstr "阿扎米尔遭袭的事远未被遗忘，但幸存者间这安静的一刻，确实开始抚平小镇的伤痛。"

msgid "With you and [Companion Name]'s help, you manage to break up the debris in short order, and Hapren directs much of the salvageable materials to be stored for reconstruction efforts, and the wood that is too mangled to be used to be left in the square to be used for the bonfire."
msgstr "在你和[Companion Name]的帮助下，残骸很快就敲碎了；哈普伦让人把大部分还能用的材料存起来备重建之用，而那些损坏太严重、无法使用的木头则留在广场上，用来烧篝火。"

msgid "Just as you set your tools down, a few tired looking folks make their way into the center of town, fishing gear in hand."
msgstr "你刚把工具放下，几个看上去很疲惫的人就拿着钓具走进了镇中心。"

msgid "Wow, do you think it was on purpose?"
msgstr "哇，你觉得那是故意的吗？"

msgid "Yeah, I'm... know to locate some stuff, from time to time."
msgstr "是啊，我……时不时会去找点东西，你知道的。"

msgid "You all can keep fishing. Try not to reel in... anything green."
msgstr "你们继续钓吧。尽量别钓上来……绿的东西。"

msgid "You all spend awhile on the pebble bank, sitting and waiting for a fish to bite, as one typically does while fishing. You and [Companion Name] talk to the fishermen for a while and learn that they used to be able to pull out enough fish to feed half the town, even without the bait. When you dump bait in the water, and start using some on your hooks, things pick up, but it's still rather slow. You watch even more junk float by. Bits of tree branches, huge clumps of soil, and then, a dead Golbin. The fishers point out that it's been like this for a few days, minus the Golbins at least."
msgstr "你们在卵石滩上待了一阵，坐着等鱼上钩，就像钓鱼时通常那样。你和[Companion Name]跟渔夫们聊了一会儿，得知他们以前就算没有饵，也能钓出半个镇子吃的鱼。当你们往水里撒饵、又给钩子上挂了一些后，情况好转了，但还是慢得很。你看着更多垃圾漂过：树枝碎片、大团泥土，然后是一只死掉的哥布林。渔夫们指出，这种情况已经持续好几天了——至少以前没有哥布林。"

msgid "You and [Companion Name] reach the gate first and take out your axes, followed by a small group of other militia members who follow suit and get to work. Another group comes with large shields that they hold with both hands, more table than shield. But they work well as the shield group form a defensive shell around you and overhead, giving you room to work without worrying about an arrow finding its way in your unprotected back."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]最先冲到大门口，拿出斧头；一小队民兵紧随其后，也照做着动起手来。另一队人扛着需要双手持的大盾，与其说是盾，不如说像桌面。但它们确实顶用：盾队在你周围和头顶结成一层防护，让你能安心干活，不必担心有箭射进你毫无防备的后背。"

msgid "You ask what the tool even is, and Gloob starts to describe a magical length of metal fashioned after a knife that, when activated, starts to vibrate rapidly. It should be enough to quietly carve away at the wall, albeit slowly. You leave Gloob to his inspection of the wall, and head off to get some silver."
msgstr "你问那到底是什么工具，格鲁布开始描述一段仿照小刀打造的魔法金属；启动后会快速振动。它应该足以悄无声息地削开墙面，只是慢一些。你让格鲁布继续检查墙上情况，自己动身去弄些银。"

msgid "You believe this little green booger, don't you?"
msgstr "你信这个绿鼻涕虫，是吧？"

msgid "You carefully bring the volatile runes down to the Foggy Canyon along with Gloob and set to work tucking them into the rock. Gloob lights them as you move away, and sure enough, they work exceedingly well. Gloob stands triumphantly as bits of rock pelt the two of you after the series of explosions."
msgstr "你和格鲁布小心地把爆裂符文带到雾峡谷，开始把它们塞进岩石缝里。你退开时，格鲁布点燃了它们，果然效果极佳。一连串爆炸后石块飞溅到你们俩身上，格鲁布得意地站着。"

msgid "You certainly lost a bit of skin from arrows that passed by a bit too close for comfort, but after a while, the villagers' shots start to resemble straight flight paths. A couple folks pick it up faster than the others, among them, [Companion Name], though you still could hardly say you felt safe just yet."
msgstr "被过于贴近的箭擦过，你确实掉了点皮，但过了一阵，村民们的箭开始有了笔直的弹道。有几个人掌握得比别人快，其中就有[Companion Name]，不过你还说不上自己已经感到安全。"

msgid "Initially, Jass seemed to be a bit frustrated at not being able to join in the demonstration, but fell into her own role guiding people and repeating your instructions to those that seemed to struggle the first few times around, or giving pointers that even you started to incorporate into your own shots."
msgstr "刚开始，贾斯似乎因为无法参与示范而有些沮丧，但很快进入了自己的角色：指导众人，把你说过的要点重复给前几次明显吃力的人，还给出一些连你后来也用到自己射术里的提示。"

msgid "By the end of the day, the villagers didn't seem to actively be putting one another in danger, and looked far more determined than they did at the start of the drill, and you entrust them into Jass's tutelage, for better or worse."
msgstr "到傍晚，村民们似乎已经不会再主动把彼此置于危险之中，神情也比刚开始训练时坚定许多，你便把他们交给贾斯管教，不论结果好坏。"

msgid "You could say that. I see that the town square is just about ready, but I'm sorry... It'll take us a week to have enough fish at this rate."
msgstr "可以这么说。我看广场差不多准备好了，但抱歉……照这个速度，我们得花一周才能凑够鱼。"

msgid "You gather your things and leave your bed behind, meeting up with Jass and a couple of folks just outside. Some of them hold the bows [Companion Name] helped them make, some holding new ones they must have created themselves. However, any decent force has variety - archers wouldn't fare well if the Golbins got in their ranks - and their inventiveness hasn't improved in the short time since you helped them last. Jass asks for a couple of new toys for the folks that haven't taken well to the bow."
msgstr "你收拾好东西、离开床铺，在外面与贾斯和几个人会合。有人拿着[Companion Name]帮忙做的弓，有人拿着他们想必自己做的新弓。不过，任何像样的队伍都得有些变化——如果哥布林冲进队伍中，弓箭手就糟了——而自上次帮忙以来这短短的时间里，他们的创造力也没见长进。贾斯要你给那些不擅长用弓的人弄几样新家伙。"

msgid "You hand off the bars to Gloob back in Azamire, and not long after, he shows up on your doorstep, carrying a sheet wrapped around the vibrating knife he described. He happily hands it over."
msgstr "你回到阿扎米尔把银锭交给格鲁布，没过多久，他就出现在你门口，抱着一块布包着他描述过的那把振动刀。他高兴地把它交给你。"

msgid "You just start to drift off to sleep before a frantic pounding at your door makes you jump up and start grabbing for something nearby to protect yourself. Your door opens a bit more gently than you'd expect considering the knocking, and you find [Companion Name] looking worried with a young woman behind her. She holds up something about as thick as your finger with a sickly pale yellow hue."
msgstr "你刚要睡着，一阵急促的砸门声让你惊跳起来，伸手去抓身边能防身的东西。考虑到敲门的力度，门开得比你预想的轻一些；只见[Companion Name]满面担忧，身后站着一个年轻女人。她举起一个约手指粗细、泛着病态淡黄色的东西。"

msgid "You look around as the movement begins to settle. The Golbin force was larger than you had anticipated, but your efforts went as well as could be expected. Among the bodies littering the forest floor, from what you could see, only a couple were human, which was better than expected considering their experience."
msgstr "动静开始平息，你环顾四周。哥布林的数量比你预想的多，但你们的努力已算尽可能顺利。散落在林地里的尸体中，就你所见只有两三具是人类——考虑到他们的经验，这比预想要好。"

msgid "You rush over as you hear a shout from Jass, who managed to pin a dark green Golbin to ground. The beast would have hardly came up to your hip had it been on its feet, and you could hear it whimpering and begging not to be hurt. It quickly rattles off fragments of information that it thinks could be useful, detailing how its clan was taken over by a rival group led by someone it called the 'Ringleader', its own name - Gloob - and how it really really wants to live. Jass slaps her hand over its mouth and asks it where the girl they kidnapped was, and why they took her. Gloob goes one step further, and says that it'll lead you all there to its nearby camp, and that they were going to try and paint him and sell him off too, whatever that may mean."
msgstr "贾斯的一声呼喊让你冲了过去，她把一只深绿色的哥布林按在了地上。那野兽要是站着，还不到你的腰，你能听见它抽泣着哀求别伤害它。它飞快地吐出一串自认为有用的信息：说它的族群被一个由它称作「首领」的家伙率领的敌对团伙接管，说出了自己的名字——格鲁布——以及它有多么多么想活下去。贾斯一手捂住它的嘴，问它他们抓走的女孩在哪、为什么抓她。格鲁布更进一步，说它愿意带你们去附近的营地，还说他们本来也打算把它涂上漆卖掉，不管那是什么意思。"

msgid "You discuss it briefly together, and decide to 'trust' it to do as it says. Surely enough, the camp is close, and the leftover defenders quickly scatter as they see they're vastly outnumbered, leaving their camp behind. You and [Companion Name] quickly find Ana in one of their tents and take her home, while Jass and the militia handle a dozen or so other folks who had been captured from elsewhere throughout the countryside. Ana's mother meets you just outside of Azamire with tears in her eyes, thanking you over and over again for saving her daughter."
msgstr "你们简短商议后，决定「信任」它照说的去做。果然，营地就在附近；留守的守军见寡不敌众便迅速四散，丢下了营地。你和[Companion Name]很快在其中一顶帐篷里找到了安娜，把她带回家；贾斯和民兵则处理了十几个从乡间别处抓来的人。安娜的母亲在阿扎米尔外泪眼婆娑地迎上你们，一遍又一遍地感谢你救了她女儿。"

msgid "You manage to pull Jass aside long enough to get her to calm down. She apologies, first to you, then even to Gloob, and says that when she learned that they were capturing people to 'send them somewhere' it sent her over the edge. She asks Gloob to fill you in on what he told her. Every full moon, a bunch of robed figures end up coming to the Ringleader's fortress within the Elder Grove. They come with large, wooden wagons, and leave with people that the surrounding Golbin tribes have captured."
msgstr "你设法把贾斯拉到一旁，让她冷静下来。她先向你道歉，甚至也向格鲁布道了歉，说当她得知他们在抓人「送到某个地方」时，自己就失控了。她让格鲁布把他告诉她的内容也讲给你听：每逢满月，一群身披长袍的人都会来到长者林间首领的堡垒。他们带着巨大的木制货车前来，带走周边哥布林部落抓来的人。"

msgid "He goes on to say that the Golbins at the fortress leave with the robed figures, escorting them... wherever they go, he doesn't know. With the nearing full-moon, it'd be a great chance to get a peek into the fortress, and that he'd even go, but that he'd need some climbing gear and hooks to scale the fort's outer wall. Either hopefully or foolishly, you decide to trust him, and he details how he'd go about making the equipment. You and Jass decide it'd be good to bring [Companion Name] along as well, and that they'd go over Gloob's memory of the fort to plan the scouting mission while you make the gear."
msgstr "他接着说，堡垒里的哥布林会跟着那些长袍人离开，护送他们去……去哪他不知道。满月将至，这是窥探堡垒的好机会；他甚至愿意一起去，但需要一些攀爬装备和钩子来翻越堡垒外墙。无论是出于期望还是愚蠢，你决定信任他，他便详细说明该怎么制作这些装备。你和贾斯决定也带上[Companion Name]，由他们梳理格鲁布对堡垒的记忆来规划侦察任务，同时你负责制作装备。"

msgid "You okay, [Player Name]?"
msgstr "你还好吗，[Player Name]？"

msgid "You too, [Player Name]. You too."
msgstr "你也是，[Player Name]。你也是。"

msgid "You walk Gloob through finding good spots for the bolts, and leave him to mark spots in the canyon that'll work well. Then you start to work out how to create strong enough rock bolts to keep the canyon walls from collapsing in on themselves."
msgstr "你带着格鲁布走了一遍如何找岩栓的好位置，让他去标记峡谷里合适的地方。然后你开始琢磨怎么做足够坚固的岩栓，让峡谷壁不至于自行塌陷。"

msgid "You worry for a moment that one of the militia members is being too loud before you see it. A group of Golbins, sauntering up with hardly a care in the world, barking orders at one another, trying to surround you and [Companion Name]. It's... more than you expected, and as you start to get up to defend yourself, an arrow sinks right between the leading Golbin's shoulder blades. "
msgstr "你有一瞬间担心某个民兵声音太响，然后就看见了。一群哥布林大摇大摆地走来，仿佛毫不在意，彼此吆喝着命令，试图包围你和[Companion Name]。数量……比你预想的多；就在你起身准备自卫时，一支箭正扎进领头哥布林的两块肩胛骨之间。 "

msgid "You'd bet. We've got to carry it all out and then sprinkle it through the woods. If a patrol came across a random pile of dirt, that'd be... suspicious."
msgstr "说得对。我们得把它全部运出去，再撒到林子里。如果巡逻队碰上一堆莫名其妙的土，那可……挺可疑的。"

msgid "You're able to cut through the wall after a fair bit of effort, and finally, the chunk of wood settles. You set the tool down beside you and decide to leave it there, in case anyone needs to improve upon your work. Once you're done, you carefully leave the tunnel and cover the entrance once again, before reporting back to Jass. She sends for a few people to go continue with the rest of the tunnel and assures you that it'll be ready for when you need to get the prisoners out."
msgstr "费了不少力气，你终于切穿了那面墙，那块木头也终于落定。你把工具放在身旁，决定就留在这儿，万一有人需要在你成果的基础上继续改进。完成后，你小心地离开隧道，重新把入口遮好，然后回去向贾斯汇报。她派人继续挖完隧道的其余部分，并向你保证，到你需要救出囚犯时它一定能准备好。"

msgid "You're going to go check it out, aren't you?"
msgstr "你要去看看，是吧？"

msgid "You're not alone in your sentiment. I came by to see if you two might be interested in a little project."
msgstr "有这种想法的不是你一个人。我来看看你们俩有没有兴趣做个小项目。"

msgid "You're not wrong. And the thing you're holding?"
msgstr "你说得没错。还有你手上拿的那东西？"

msgid "You're on."
msgstr "就这么说定了。"

msgid "You, Gloob, and [Companion Name] set off into the Misty Thicket on the night of the full moon. Gloob brings you through the woods quickly, and it's tough to keep up with his speed. You and [Companion Name] find yourselves huffing and puffing just outside of the Ringleader's Fortress. In the moonlight, you all see a train of wagons and hobgolbins heading to the north along an old dirt road, but quickly lose track of it as they slip into the dense thicket."
msgstr "满月之夜，你、格鲁布和[Companion Name]进入迷雾密林。格鲁布带着你们快速穿林，他那速度很难跟上。你和[Companion Name]到了首领堡垒外时已经气喘吁吁。月光下，你们看见一列车队和大哥布林沿一条旧土路向北而去，但他们钻入浓密灌木后便很快不见了踪影。"

msgid "With them gone, the three of you use the gear you prepared and scale the walls, landing quietly on the other side. Gloob brings you to several spots throughout the relatively open grounds. A small, ramshackle prison, with several ents patrolling just outside. You pass by a handful of sleeping areas for the fort's living guards, until you reach a large wooden hut Gloob says is the Ringleader's home. Finally, he leads you to a stockpile of various bits that a Golbin would find valuable, taken as tribute or looted from nearby towns. Hides, half-rotten food, weapons and armor, gold, and most notably, dozens upon dozens of caskets of flammable oil and booze."
msgstr "它们走后，你们三人用准备好的装备翻过城墙，悄悄落在另一侧。格鲁布带你们看了这片相对开阔的场地里的几个位置：一座简陋的小监狱，外面有几只树人在巡逻。你们经过几处供堡垒活着的守卫睡觉的地方，直到来到一座大木屋前——格鲁布说那是首领的住处。最后，他把你们带到一个堆满哥布林眼中值钱物件的仓库，这些是以贡品形式收取或从附近城镇掠夺来的：兽皮、半腐烂的食物、武器和护甲、黄金，最引人注目的是几十口装满易燃油脂和酒的箱子。"

msgid "You and [Companion Name] wait for Gloob to lead you into an ambush, but the trap never comes. True to his word, once he finishes with the important parts of the fortress, the three of you scale back over the wall and head back to Azamire. When you return, you immediately begin talks with Jass about launching an assault on the fortress with what you've learned, and set plans into motion to get the town ready. Clearing a path to bring wagons to the fort, and securing an exit route for prisoners will be essential before launching an attack. Plus, it gives Jass more time to get her people ready, too."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]等着格鲁布把你们引进埋伏，但陷阱始终没有出现。他的话属实：看完堡垒里重要的部分后，你们三人又翻墙回去，返回阿扎米尔。回来后，你立刻和贾斯商量，依据所见所闻对堡垒发起进攻，并着手让小镇做好准备。在发起进攻之前，清出一条能把货车送到堡垒的路、并为囚犯确保一条撤离路线，都至关重要。此外，这也给了贾斯更多时间让她的人做好准备。"

msgid "[Companion Name] and I have actually helped out in Azamire's mines a few times through the years."
msgstr "这些年[Companion Name]和我其实在阿扎米尔的矿里帮过几次忙。"

msgid "[Companion Name] glares at you, but you've known them long enough to know there's no real anger there, just like they know you have no malice in your light banter."
msgstr "[Companion Name]瞪了你一眼，但你认识他们够久，知道那里面没有真的怒气；就像他们也知道你这些轻松的玩笑里没有恶意。"

msgid "Though, you start to think otherwise when the villagers pick up their bows and start trying to hit the targets. You feel as though their arrows pass by you more often than the targets. You get to work quickly, trying to show them how to draw, aim, and fire, before they really hurt someone."
msgstr "不过，当村民们拿起弓开始射靶时，你就开始改观了。你感觉他们的箭从你身边擦过的次数比命中靶子还多。你赶紧上手，教他们怎么拉弓、瞄准、放箭，免得真伤到人。"

msgid "[Companion Name] leads you to the river where the girl went missing. You fondly recall learning to swim with [Companion Name] here, years ago, and wish you were here under less dire circumstances. The militia disperses through the surrounding forest, headed by Jass who quietly gives orders, trying to get people hidden as best she can."
msgstr "[Companion Name]带你来到女孩失踪的那条河边。你怀念地想起多年前在这里和[Companion Name]一起学游泳，恨不得这次来时的情形没那么凶险。民兵散入周围树林，由贾斯带队低声下令，尽量把人藏好。"

msgid "You and [Companion Name] settle in by the riverbank, and pull out your rods, hoping to catch a bit more than just a few fish. You're a bit too nervous for idle conversation, so you both quietly fall into a rhythm, just trying to look like two innocuous people fishing late into the night."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]在河岸边安顿下来，掏出钓竿，希望能钓到的不仅是几条鱼。你紧张得无心闲聊，于是两人默默进入了节奏，只是努力装成两个在深夜钓鱼的无害之人。"

msgid "[Companion Name] looks to you and searches your face, trying to gauge your reaction. You shrug, and then offer to help. Getting together a bit of bait to help the fishers out, then showing them how to work with the river shouldn't take too long, and it'd be nice for the town to be able to keep itself fed."
msgstr "[Companion Name]看向你，端详着你的脸，想看出你的反应。你耸耸肩，然后提出帮忙。凑些饵料帮渔夫们一把，再教他们怎么配合这条河，应该不会太久，而且镇上能自己养活自己也挺好。"

msgid "[Companion Name] manages to quietly eat the cake you give them, and you decide to wait a while before beginning your round of questioning. Once they finish the first half, your questioning begins, and they fake passing out. You roll your eyes, and threaten to take the rest of the cake away and they spring back up, but quickly nurse their wounds after the sudden movement. You ask what happened, how they feel, and what they why they've been avoiding you, but [Companion Name] remains silent for all of it. When you finally ask why they didn't bring you, tears well up in their eyes."
msgstr "[Companion Name]勉强安静地吃完了你给的蛋糕，你决定先等一会儿再开始问话。他们吃下前半块后，你的提问开始了，结果他们假装晕过去。你翻了个白眼，威胁要把剩下的蛋糕拿走，他们立刻弹起来，但被这突然的动作牵动了伤口。你问发生了什么、感觉怎么样、为什么一直躲着你，但[Companion Name]全程沉默。当你终于问出为什么不带上你时，泪水在他们眼里涌了上来。"

msgid "[Companion Name] turns towards you and wobbles on their feet. Even in the low light, you notice the dark red patch blood on the front of their cloak, and trailing down their arms. You rush towards them and manage to catch your best friend before they hit the ground. You quickly run through a list of places you could bring them before settling on their own place. You quickly fish their key out of their pocket and carry them inside. You'd complain about them being heavy if it weren't for the fact your heart was beating out of your chest, knowing how hurt they are and having no idea on why or how."
msgstr "[Companion Name]朝你转过身，脚下晃了晃。即使在昏暗的光下，你也注意到他们斗篷前襟那片暗红的血迹，还有顺着手臂流下的痕迹。你冲过去，在挚友倒地前接住了他们。你飞快地在脑中过了一遍能带他们去的地方，最后选定他们自己的住处。你从他们口袋里摸出钥匙，把他们抱了进去。要不是心脏快跳出胸腔、明知他们伤得有多重却完全不知道原因和经过，你本会抱怨他们太重。"

msgid "Digging through both their supplies and yours, you find enough to get them patched up. Across their chest is a large gash with bits of... wood, sticking out of it? You extract it all, bit by bit, in the lantern light, and stitch them back up before wrapping them in gauze. The rest of their wounds are comparatively minor, and take much less time to deal with, but they are numerous, and in various states of healing, some old, some fresh."
msgstr "你翻遍他们和你的补给，找到了足够的东西替他们包扎。他们胸前是一道巨大的伤口，里面还突出着一些……木头？你在提灯的光下一点一点全部取出，缝合好，再用纱布包上。其余伤口相对较轻，处理起来快得多，但数量不少，且处于不同的愈合阶段，有的陈旧，有的新鲜。"

msgid "Once you're done, [Companion Name] looks more mummy than person, but they'll live. You cover them up to let them rest, and decide to help along their recovery with their favorite food."
msgstr "处理完后，[Companion Name]看起来更像木乃伊而不是人，但他们能活下来。你替他们盖好被子让他们休息，并决定用他们最爱的食物帮他们恢复。"

msgid "[Companion Name]'s look of anxiety hidden under bravado is quickly replaced with confidence as the woods explode with movement. The militia lets loose a volley of arrows that pepper the unprepared Golbins, scattering them and sending a few more to the ground. What's left of them gather themselves and charge towards you and your friend, or the quickly approaching villagers armed with swords."
msgstr "树林里骤然动起来，[Companion Name]那藏在逞强之下的不安立刻被自信取代。民兵放出一轮齐射，箭雨落在毫无准备的哥布林身上，把他们打散，又有几个倒地。剩下的重整后，朝你和你的朋友冲来，或者扑向那些迅速逼近、手持刀剑的村民。"

msgid "[Companion Name], I'm not really sure what's going on, but if I did something, please... Let me know, okay?"
msgstr "[Companion Name]，我不太确定发生了什么，但如果我做了什么，请……告诉我，好吗？"

msgid "[Player Name], I'm with you. Trust me! I'll keep you safe!"
msgstr "[Player Name]，我跟你一起。相信我！我会保护你！"

msgid "[Player Name]..."
msgstr "[Player Name]……"

msgid " {Value:0.##%;-#.##%} of {LocalContext.Category.DisplayName} bonuses provided while growing in {LocalContext.Component.Entity.DisplayName}"
msgstr " {Value:0.##%;-#.##%} 的{LocalContext.Category.DisplayName}加成，在{LocalContext.Component.Entity.DisplayName}中生长时提供"

msgid "Agility Marks no longer disappear when failing obstacles"
msgstr "障碍失败时敏捷标记不再消失"

msgid "Cannot lose items to death"
msgstr "死亡时不会损失物品"

msgid "Convert Junk to GP for {Value:+0,0.##%;-#.##%} of its sale price in {LocalContext.Component.Entity.DisplayName}"
msgstr "在{LocalContext.Component.Entity.DisplayName}中，将垃圾按售价的 {Value:+0,0.##%;-#.##%} 转换为金币"

msgid "Disables the area effect for {LocalContext.Area.DisplayName}"
msgstr "禁用{LocalContext.Area.DisplayName}的区域效果"

msgid "Immune to {LocalContext.CombatStyle.DisplayName}"
msgstr "对{LocalContext.CombatStyle.DisplayName}免疫"

msgid "Lifesteal Disabled"
msgstr "吸血已禁用"

msgid "Unlocks the Bonfire in Firemaking"
